hts groups that had been tracking the boats lost sight of them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/01/world/asia/rohingya-muslim-refugee-crisis.html', 'snippet': 'At least three boats carrying Rohingya refugees have been adrift for more than two months. As of this week, rights groups that had been tracking the boats lost sight of them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BANGKOK — Somewhere in turquoise waters, perhaps where the Bay of Bengal meets the Andaman Sea, wooden boats filled with Rohingya refugees are listing, adrift now for more than 10 weeks.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/30/world/30Rohingya3/merlin_171632292_4cfb39a2-c905-493c-8f51-51f6dadd49dd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/04/30/world/30Rohingya3/merlin_171632292_4cfb39a2-c905-493c-8f51-51f6dadd49dd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/30/world/30Rohingya3/merlin_171632292_4cfb39a2-c905-493c-8f51-51f6dadd49dd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/30/world/30Rohingya3/merlin_171632292_4cfb39a2-c905-493c-8f51-51f6dadd49dd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/30/world/30Rohingya3/merlin_171632292_4cfb39a2-c905-493c-8f51-51f6dadd49dd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/202