mes when government must curtail individual freedoms to protect the public. But those measures must end once the threat passes.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/01/opinion/coronavirus-civil-liberties.html', 'snippet': 'There are times when government must curtail individual freedoms to protect the public. But those measures must end once the threat passes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The tension between private liberty and public health in the United States is hardly new. Americans have demanded the latter in times of plague and prioritized the former in times of well-being since at least the Colonial Era. Politicians and business leaders have alternately manipulated and deferred to that tension for about as long.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/01/opinion/01civilSub/merlin_156441681_22ea0cfc-520d-4f57-9a50-809f2b6561e3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/01/opinion/01civilSub/merlin_156441681_22ea0cfc-520d-4f57-9a50-809f2b6561e3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/01/opinion/01civilSub/merlin_156441681_22ea0cfc-520d-4f57-9a50-809f2b6561e3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/01/opinion/01civilSub/merlin_156441681_22ea0cfc-520d-4f57-9a50-809f2b6561e3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/01/opinion/01civilSub/01civilSub-t