': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/3a15dfe1-8668-50d9-9037-f99a0cd8f056', 'word_count': 683, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3a15dfe1-8668-50d9-9037-f99a0cd8f056'}, {'abstract': 'A university review found that the disgraced financier, who killed himself last year, visited Harvard more than 40 times after he was convicted of sex charges involving a minor in Florida.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/01/us/jeffrey-epstein-harvard.html', 'snippet': 'A university review found that the disgraced financier, who killed himself last year, visited Harvard more than 40 times after he was convicted of sex charges involving a minor in Florida.', 'lead_paragraph': 'He had no official Harvard affiliation, yet Jeffrey Epstein had his own office, key card and Harvard phone line. He would often swing by on weekends to host dinners with academics he wanted to meet.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/22/us/22virus-harvard-epstein/merlin_170580228_4a0bdd74-0647-4cc2-b7bc-3f0a1db75bcb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/04/22/us/22virus-harvard-epstein/merlin_170580228_4a0bdd74-0647-4cc2-b7bc-3f0a1db75bcb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/22/us/22virus-harvard-epstein/merlin_170580228_4a0bdd74-0647-4cc2-b7bc-3f0a1db75bcb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/22/us/22virus-harvard-epstein/merlin_170580228_4a0bdd74-0647-4cc2-b7bc-3f0a1db75bcb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height'