 Republicans in competitive districts are navigating a careful balance in addressing the coronavirus crisis, eager to put some distance between themselves and a president whose response has been criticized.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/02/us/politics/coronavirus-trump-republicans.html', 'snippet': 'Moderate Republicans in competitive districts are navigating a careful balance in addressing the coronavirus crisis, eager to put some distance between themselves and a president whose response has been criticized.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Every evening from his kitchen table in southwestern Michigan, Representative Fred Upton, a moderate Republican running for his 18th term in office, posts a coronavirus dispatch for his constituents, highlighting his own efforts to respond to the crisis and the news from Washington, often with cameos from Democrats.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/30/us/politics/00dc-moderates1/merlin_157759152_2fed06e2-677c-4f66-a212-a403bb3e4b07-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/04/30/us/politics/00dc-moderates1/merlin_157759152_2fed06e2-677c-4f66-a212-a403bb3e4b07-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/30/us/politics/00dc-moderates1/merlin_157759152_2fed06e2-677c-4f66-a212-a403bb3e4b07-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/30/us/politics/00dc-moderates1/merlin_157759152_2fed06e2-677c-4f66-a212-a403bb3e4b07-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJum