erishable medium, and our supply chains are complex and vulnerable,” explains the Manhattan-based floral designer Emily Thompson, who hopes to reopen soon.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/02/t-magazine/florists-slide-RP8B/florists-slide-RP8B-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 809, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/02/t-magazine/florists-slide-RP8B/florists-slide-RP8B-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 809}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/02/t-magazine/florists-slide-RP8B/florists-slide-RP8B-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 760, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/02/t-magazine/florists-slide-RP8B/florists-slide-RP8B-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1519, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/02/t-magazine/florists-slide-RP8B/florists-slide-RP8B-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/02/t-magazine/florists-slide-RP8B/florists-slide-RP8B-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/02/t-magazine/florists-slide-RP8B/florists-slide-RP8B-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '10 Florists Delivering Vibrant Bouquets for Mother’s Day', 'kicker': None, 'conte