a result of the coronavirus pandemic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/03/business/media/britain-newspapers-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'Heavily dependent on advertising and circulation, local and regional newspapers in the U.K. could face financial ruin as a result of the coronavirus pandemic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Normally, when Michael Purton has a question for one of his reporters about a story, he shouts it across the newsroom. An answer usually follows within a few seconds.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/04/business/00virus-ukmedia1-print/merlin_172012716_2455489e-594c-4fdf-841e-d385d0e76b60-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/04/business/00virus-ukmedia1-print/merlin_172012716_2455489e-594c-4fdf-841e-d385d0e76b60-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/04/business/00virus-ukmedia1-print/merlin_172012716_2455489e-594c-4fdf-841e-d385d0e76b60-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/04/business/00virus-ukmedia1-print/merlin_172012716_2455489e-594c-4fdf-841e-d385d0e76b60-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/04/business/00virus-ukmedia1-print/00virus-ukmedia-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/04/business/00virus-ukmedia1-print/00virus-ukmedia-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/04/business/00virus-ukmedia1-print/00virus-ukmedia-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'More Readers, Fewer Ads: Britain’s Local Newspapers Are Struggling', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Newspapers in Britain Struggle With Fewer Ads but More Readers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Online Advertising', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newspapers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Layoffs and Job Reductions', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-03T19:04:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Claire Moses', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Claire', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Moses', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ae3dc32b-061f-5340-8678-cb61b12988c7', 'word_count': 1031, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ae3dc32b-061f-5340-8678-cb61b12988c7'}, {'abstract': 'A virtual send-off for the artistic director and playwright drew more attendees than could have fit under a tent. “I liked this better,” she said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/03/theater/emily-mann-mccarter-theater.html', 'snippet': 'A virtual send-off for the artistic director and playwright drew more attendees than could have fit under a tent. “I liked this better,” she said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Had this been a normal spring, Emily Mann would have wrapped up her three decades as artistic director of McCarter Theater Center in Princeton, N.J., in the traditional way, with colleagues and patrons gathered under a tent to toast her at a gala. Instead, on Saturday night, they gave her a virtual tribute on Zoom, which she watched, teary-eyed, from her living room.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/04/arts/03EXIT-MANN-1/merlin_172144926_d37a46fa-699f-4fb6-9456-5279c7514763-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/04/arts/03EXIT-MANN-1/merlin_172144926_d37a46fa-699f-4fb6-9456-5279c7514763-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/04/arts/03EXIT-MANN-1/merlin_172144926_d37a46fa-699f-4fb6-9456-5279c7514763-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/04/arts/03EXIT-MANN-1/merlin_172144926_d37a46fa-699f-4fb6-9456-5279c7514763-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/04/arts/03EXIT-MANN-1/03EXIT-MANN-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/04/arts/03EXIT-MANN-1/03EXI