uld change this fall’s election and every election after.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/04/opinion/coronavirus-vote-by-mail.html', 'snippet': 'Our new paper shows vote-by-mail dramatically boosted Colorado’s turnout. It could change this fall’s election and every election after.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As the coronavirus continues to spread throughout the country, there are growing concerns about whether in-person voting can be conducted safely in the months ahead, including for the November presidential election. A huge expansion of mail voting is one way to ensure that participating in democracy won’t undermine public health.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/04/opinion/04hill-graphic/04hill-graphic-articleLarge.png', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/04/opinion/04hill-graphic/04hill-graphic-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/04/opinion/04hill-graphic/04hill-graphic-jumbo.png', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/04/opinion/04hill-graphic/04hill-graphic-superJumbo.png', 'height': 998, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/04/opinion/04hill-graphic/04hill-graphic-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/04/opinion/04hill-graphic/04hill-graphic-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank':