'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quarantines', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARCHAEOLOGY AND ANTHROPOLOGY', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Layoffs and Job Reductions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'City University of New York', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Queens College, City University of New York', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hooks, Bell', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Queens (NYC)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-04T09:00:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Strassler', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Strassler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/6840f1cb-732f-57b4-b3da-673a6d40dab3', 'word_count': 1182, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6840f1cb-732f-57b4-b3da-673a6d40dab3'}, {'abstract': 'In a wide-ranging interview from his home quarantine, the comedian says his new Netflix special may be his last. Still, he is optimistic about the return of live comedy after the pandemic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/04/arts/television/jerry-seinfeld-netflix.html', 'snippet': 'In a wide-ranging interview from his home quarantine, the comedian says his new Netflix special may be his last. Still, he is optimistic about the return of live comedy after the pandemic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Many of us have been wondering lately what Jerry Seinfeld, the sitcom character, would be doing in this current era of home quarantines and social distancing: how his extreme fastidiousness, self-centeredness and constant scrutiny of quotidian details (not to mention the hyperbolic traits of his fictional friends and neighbors) would be stretched to hilarious extremes in an environment of isolation and anxiety.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/04/arts/04seinfeld4/merlin_172152432_2d68e87a-9573-40e0-a5e2-d152f27a287c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/04/arts/04seinfeld4/merlin_172152432_2d68e87a-9573-40e0-a5e2-d152f27a287c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/04/arts/04seinfeld4/merlin_172152432_2d68e87a-9573-40e0-a5e2-d152f27a287c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/04/arts/04seinfeld4/merlin_172152432_2d68e87a-9573-40e0-a5e2-d152f27a287c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/04/arts/04seinfeld4/04seinfeld4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/04/arts/04seinfeld4/04seinfeld4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/04/arts/04seinfeld4/04seinfeld4-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Jerry Seinfeld Is Making Peace With Nothing: He’s ‘Post-Show Business’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'prin