59', 'word_count': 1180, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9fc37a8d-ff7b-51bf-8e25-4f3d598ace59'}, {'abstract': 'According to a state audit, Mississippi allowed tens of millions of dollars in federal anti-poverty funds to be used in ways that did little or nothing to help the poor.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/04/us/mississippi-department-human-services.html', 'snippet': 'According to a state audit, Mississippi allowed tens of millions of dollars in federal anti-poverty funds to be used in ways that did little or nothing to help the poor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATLANTA — The state of Mississippi allowed tens of millions of dollars in federal anti-poverty funds to be used in ways that did little or nothing to help the poor, with two nonprofit groups instead using the money on lobbyists, football tickets, religious concerts and fitness programs for state lawmakers, according to a scathing audit released on Monday.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/04/us/04MISSISSIPPI/merlin_168497259_85aa247e-703e-44bc-96a0-91fdd01520ff-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/04/us/04MISSISSIPPI/merlin_168497259_85aa247e-703e-44bc-96a0-91fdd01520ff-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/04/us/04MISSISSIPPI/merlin_168497259_85aa247e-703e-44bc-96a0-91fdd01520ff-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/04/us/04MISSISSIPPI/merlin_168497259_85aa247e-703e-44bc-96a0-91fdd01520ff-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJu