rigo Duterte’s brutal war on drugs that has left thousands of people dead. Such coverage has made it a target of the administration.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MANILA — A leading media network in the Philippines was forced off the air on Tuesday, making it the first major broadcaster to have met such a fate during the administration of President Rodrigo Duterte, which is cracking down on news outlets that have been critical of his leadership.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/05/world/05philippines-1-copy2/05philippines-1-copy2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/05/world/05philippines-1-copy2/05philippines-1-copy2-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/05/world/05philippines-1-copy2/05philippines-1-copy2-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/05/world/05philippines-1-copy2/05philippines-1-copy2-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/05/world/05philippines-1-copy2/05philippines-1-copy2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/05/world/05philippines-1-copy2/05philippines-1-copy2-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/05/world/05philippines-1-copy2/05philippines-1-copy2-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Leading Philippine Broadcaster, Target of Duterte’s Ire, Forced Off the Air', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'TV Giant in Philippines Is Closed by Government', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Human Rights and Human Rights Violations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Duterte, Rodrigo', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Philippines', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ABS-CBN Corp', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-05T14:35:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jason Gutierrez', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jason', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gutierrez', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/94392fbb-daa0-5499-9477-fd5cfce6c653', 'word_count': 796, 'uri': 'nyt://article/94392fbb-daa0-5499-9477-fd5cfce6c653'}, {'abstract': 'One European director said guidelines intended to get actors back to work were “cuckoo.” Some will return only when coronavirus testing, or a vaccine, allows performers to get close.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/05/theater/coronavirus-rehearsal-austria-germany.html', 'snippet': 'One European director said guidelines intended to get actors back to work were “cuckoo.” Some will return only when coronavirus testing, or a vaccine, allows performers to get close.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As much of Europe has started emerging from lockdown this week, countries are working out how they can live with the coronavirus. In Germany, you can now get a haircut; in Austria, you can play tennis (but only singles).', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/06/arts/04europe-theater1/merlin_172152207_5ae7f934-c902-42c3-83c7-01d6b8fc2679-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/06/arts/04europe-theater1/merlin_172152207_5ae7f934-c902-42c3-83c7-01d6b8fc2679-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/06/arts/04europe-theater1/merlin_172152207_5ae7f934-c902-42c3-83c7-01d6b8fc2679-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/06/arts/04europe-theater1/merlin_172152207_5ae7f934-c902-42c3-83c7-01d6b8fc2679-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1181, 'width': 1772, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/06/arts/04europe-theater1/04europe-theater1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/06/arts/04europe-theater1/04europe-theater1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/06/arts/04europe-theater1/04europe-theater1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'cro