,000 Israelis will try to assess exposure to Covid-19 on a nationwide scale.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/05/world/middleeast/coronavirus-israel-antibody-testing.html', 'snippet': 'Blood tests of 100,000 Israelis will try to assess exposure to Covid-19 on a nationwide scale.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERUSALEM — Israel, whose aggressive response to the coronavirus has held its fatality rate to a fraction of those of the United States and other hard-hit nations, is readying a nationwide serological test of 100,000 citizens to see how widely the virus has spread across its population and how vulnerable it may be to a new wave of the contagion.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/05/world/05virus-israel-1/merlin_172206318_9afd130a-83f1-4a55-80aa-00a432f39216-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/05/world/05virus-israel-1/merlin_172206318_9afd130a-83f1-4a55-80aa-00a432f39216-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/05/world/05virus-israel-1/merlin_172206318_9afd130a-83f1-4a55-80aa-00a432f39216-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/05/world/05virus-israel-1/merlin_172206318_9afd130a-83f1-4a55-80aa-00a432f39216-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/05/world/05virus-israel-1/merlin_172206318_9afd130a-83f1-4a55-80aa-00a432f39216-thumbSt