: 'Style', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc5b6f2f-ebab-546e-ade7-5ba706a40774', 'word_count': 437, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc5b6f2f-ebab-546e-ade7-5ba706a40774'}, {'abstract': 'The loan servicer pledged to make changes in how it guides borrowers seeking to use a problem-plagued program for public service workers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/05/business/student-loan-forgiveness-navient.html', 'snippet': 'The loan servicer pledged to make changes in how it guides borrowers seeking to use a problem-plagued program for public service workers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To end a lawsuit brought by a group of teachers, Navient, one of the nation’s largest student loan servicers, has agreed to alter its practices for identifying and guiding public service workers seeking to use a long-troubled loan forgiveness program.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Navient Agrees to Settle Teachers’ Loan Forgiveness Lawsuit', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Teachers and School Employees', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Government Employees', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Student Loans', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation (Civil)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN FEDERATION OF TEACHERS', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Navient Corporation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Aid (US)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-05T19:02:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stacy Cowley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stacy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cowley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/383c04ae-61d9-594b-81e5-df80e85364e8', 'word_count': 370, 'uri': 'nyt://article/383c04ae-61d9-594b-81e5-df80e85364e8'}, {'abstract': 'This country seems resigned to preventable firearm deaths. It appears that the same is starting to happen with fatalities from the pandemic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/05/opinion/coronavirus-deaths.html', 'snippet': 'This country seems resigned to preventable firearm deaths. It appears that the same is starting to happen with fatalities from the pandemic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The coronavirus scenario I can’t stop thinking about is the one where we simply get used to all the dying.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/05/opinion/00warz1/merlin_170964573_8833ed18-f579-4b74-89a8-d11864ece83a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 429, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/05/opinion/00warz1/merlin_170964573_8833ed18-f579-4b74-89a8-d11864ece83a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 429}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/05/opinion/00warz1/merlin_170964573_8833ed18-f579-4b74-89a8-d11864ece83a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 731, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/05/opinion/00warz1/merlin_170964573_8833ed18-f579-4b74-89a8-d11864ece83a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1463, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url'