cle/519f3d00-1689-50e6-a8e0-14ab65a0325c'}, {'abstract': 'On everything from climate change to marijuana, the generational divide that is evident among Democrats is no less present on the other side of the aisle. It’s just less visible.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/06/us/politics/young-republicans-trump.html', 'snippet': 'On everything from climate change to marijuana, the generational divide that is evident among Democrats is no less present on the other side of the aisle. It’s just less visible.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jose Francisco Rodriguez supports a path to citizenship for undocumented immigrants. Mary-Faith Martinez supports a public health care option. Ethan Lucky supports criminal justice reform. Autumn Crawford wants government action on climate change.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/05/us/politics/00young-republicans/merlin_169988634_edb7e253-79bc-41bb-8d16-ecb0c0167ffc-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/05/us/politics/00young-republicans/merlin_169988634_edb7e253-79bc-41bb-8d16-ecb0c0167ffc-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/05/us/politics/00young-republicans/merlin_169988634_edb7e253-79bc-41bb-8d16-ecb0c0167ffc-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/05/us/politics/00young-republicans/merlin_169988634_edb7e253-79bc-41bb-8d16-ecb0c0167ffc-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnai