 up their daughter. The country locked down before they could leave.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/06/parenting/fertility/pandemic-adoption-india.html', 'snippet': 'The Mosiers flew to India in March to pick up their daughter. The country locked down before they could leave.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The little girl, her black curls tumbling over her eyes and her slight frame uncomfortably splayed out on the airplane seat, hid crayons in her armpits the entire flight. She was puzzled how they, like the new people called Mom and Dad sitting next to her, now belonged to her.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/27/multimedia/parenting-indian-adoption/parenting-indian-adoption-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/04/27/multimedia/parenting-indian-adoption/parenting-indian-adoption-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/27/multimedia/parenting-indian-adoption/parenting-indian-adoption-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/27/multimedia/parenting-indian-adoption/parenting-indian-adoption-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1200, 'width': 1600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/04/27/multimedia/parenting-indian-adoption/parenting-indian-adoption-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/04/27/multimedia/parenting-indian-ad