you usually throw away.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/07/style/food-scraps-what-to-do-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'There’s a lot you can do with the food scraps you usually throw away.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the 1973 animated classic “Charlotte’s Web,” an entire musical number is dedicated to the film’s antagonist, a rat named Templeton, feasting on garbage at the county fair. He tosses apple cores, banana peels and turkey legs down his craw with abandon. At one point, he juggles snacks foraged from the dumpster while simultaneously using a discarded melon rind as a surfboard. The rat doesn’t merely survive on garbage — he thrives among it.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/07/fashion/07FOODSCRAPS-vegetables/merlin_172068456_1d344ad2-eea0-4946-83cd-3636667f702c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/07/fashion/07FOODSCRAPS-vegetables/merlin_172068456_1d344ad2-eea0-4946-83cd-3636667f702c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/07/fashion/07FOODSCRAPS-vegetables/merlin_172068456_1d344ad2-eea0-4946-83cd-3636667f702c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/07/fashion/07FOODSCRAPS-vegetables/merlin_172068456_1d344ad2-eea0-4946-83cd-3636667f702c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/07/fashion/07FOODSCRAPS-vegetables/07FOODSCRA