e story of Ana, a first-century woman who falls in love with an 18-year-old Jesus.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/17/books/review/17insidethelist/17insidethelist-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 678, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/17/books/review/17insidethelist/17insidethelist-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 678}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/17/books/review/17insidethelist/17insidethelist-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 907, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/17/books/review/17insidethelist/17insidethelist-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1814, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/17/books/review/17insidethelist/17insidethelist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/17/books/review/17insidethelist/17insidethelist-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/17/books/review/17insidethelist/17insidethelist-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Did Jesus Ever Tie the Knot? A New Novel Considers the Question', 'kicker': 'Inside the List', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': 