died at 73, shaped sounds that provided templates for countless varieties of electronic dance music, rock and hip-hop.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/07/arts/music/florian-schneider-kraftwerk-songs.html', 'snippet': 'The German musician, who died at 73, shaped sounds that provided templates for countless varieties of electronic dance music, rock and hip-hop.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Machines making music. Repetitive, metronomic, locked-in beats. Voices processed to sound as inexpressive as robots. A warning, and an embrace, of technology as both the shaper and subject of songs, of the ever-growing human codependence with the inhuman. In 21st-century art, especially music, these ideas and sounds are inescapable.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/08/arts/07kraftwerk-playlist1/merlin_172256304_b0a2a7f7-92c0-4305-a985-ba73c9c060a7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 910, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/08/arts/07kraftwerk-playlist1/merlin_172256304_b0a2a7f7-92c0-4305-a985-ba73c9c060a7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 910}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/08/arts/07kraftwerk-playlist1/merlin_172256304_b0a2a7f7-92c0-4305-a985-ba73c9c060a7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 676, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/08/arts/07kraftwerk-playlist1/merlin_172256304_b0a2a7f7-92c0-4305-a985-ba73c9c060a7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1352, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/0