ner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc691d1f-c5a2-57d7-a2f5-9a5913f10cf0', 'word_count': 1915, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc691d1f-c5a2-57d7-a2f5-9a5913f10cf0'}, {'abstract': 'The outsized infection rate among Hispanics in some states could hobble efforts to quash the spread of Covid-19, prompting states like Oregon to step up testing and take emergency measures.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/07/us/coronavirus-latinos-disparity.html', 'snippet': 'The outsized infection rate among Hispanics in some states could hobble efforts to quash the spread of Covid-19, prompting states like Oregon to step up testing and take emergency measures.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dr. Eva Galvez works as a family physician for a network of clinics in northwestern Oregon, where low-income patients have been streaming in for nasal swabs over the past several weeks to test for the coronavirus.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/07/us/07virus-latinos01/merlin_172177416_8dc65515-c66d-427a-9825-5059022775e0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/07/us/07virus-latinos01/merlin_172177416_8dc65515-c66d-427a-9825-5059022775e0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/07/us/07virus-latinos01/merlin_172177416_8dc65515-c66d-427a-9825-5059022775e0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 676, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/07/us/07virus-latinos01/merlin_172177416_