 stretch in the city in which police officers killed three people: a man shot by the police while he streamed the encounter live on Facebook; a pregnant woman who was fatally struck by an officer’s car; and a 19-year-old man who may have called 911 to lure the police to an apartment before firing at them.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/06/us/06INDIANAPOLIS/merlin_172275576_f14b72ef-a90c-4f36-831d-ac86561ae06d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 421, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/06/us/06INDIANAPOLIS/merlin_172275576_f14b72ef-a90c-4f36-831d-ac86561ae06d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 421}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/06/us/06INDIANAPOLIS/merlin_172275576_f14b72ef-a90c-4f36-831d-ac86561ae06d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 718, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/06/us/06INDIANAPOLIS/merlin_172275576_f14b72ef-a90c-4f36-831d-ac86561ae06d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1435, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/06/us/06INDIANAPOLIS/06INDIANAPOLIS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/06/us/06INDIANAPOLIS/06INDIANAPOLIS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/06/us/06INDIANAPOLIS/06INDIANAPOLIS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'wi