'word_count': 1200, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0767f525-eda3-572e-a294-2d63e1097258'}, {'abstract': 'If it’s spring where you live, the time is now to start planning for your future fruits and vegetables.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/08/smarter-living/how-to-start-your-own-garden.html', 'snippet': 'If it’s spring where you live, the time is now to start planning for your future fruits and vegetables.', 'lead_paragraph': 'First the raised beds arrived, three narrow boxes lining the edge of my yard. Then came the soil in a big pungent pile, demanding to be shoveled. And last weekend, I brought home trays of delicate little plants that promise a summer of Swiss chard, snap peas, tomatoes and beets.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/08/smarter-living/08virus-grow-vegetables/08virus-grow-vegetables-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/08/smarter-living/08virus-grow-vegetables/08virus-grow-vegetables-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/08/smarter-living/08virus-grow-vegetables/08virus-grow-vegetables-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/08/smarter-living/08virus-grow-vegetables/08virus-grow-vegetables-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/08/smarter-living/08virus-grow-vegetables/08virus-grow-vegetables-thumbStandard.jpg', 'h