 to minimize the risk of the virus, including an Australia-New Zealand travel “bubble,” and, in Europe, a travel “corridor” shared by Estonia, Latvia and Lithuania.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/travel/08-travel-openings-virus-top/merlin_106676857_e406e5af-f870-4a88-8d14-94cd9d13d691-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/12/travel/08-travel-openings-virus-top/merlin_106676857_e406e5af-f870-4a88-8d14-94cd9d13d691-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/travel/08-travel-openings-virus-top/merlin_106676857_e406e5af-f870-4a88-8d14-94cd9d13d691-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/travel/08-travel-openings-virus-top/merlin_106676857_e406e5af-f870-4a88-8d14-94cd9d13d691-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1362, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/travel/08-travel-openings-virus-top/merlin_106676857_e406e5af-f870-4a88-8d14-94cd9d13d691-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/12/travel/08-travel-openings-virus-top/merlin_106676857_e406e5af-f870-4a88-8d14-94cd9d13d691-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/travel/08-travel-opening