hed settlements with 162 people who were sexually assaulted when they were sent to the team doctor Richard H. Strauss.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/08/sports/ohio-state-strauss-settlement.html', 'snippet': 'The university said it had reached settlements with 162 people who were sexually assaulted when they were sent to the team doctor Richard H. Strauss.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ohio State University said Friday it would pay $41 million to resolve some of the lawsuits stemming from several hundred sexual assault claims made against a doctor for the school’s athletic department. The payouts to 162 people represent close to half the former athletes and other students who have filed lawsuits against the university because of assaults committed by Richard H. Strauss during his nearly 20 years as a team doctor.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/08/sports/08ohiostate-strauss01/merlin_164803371_fe51c921-cba9-4e45-b723-037b101435f4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/08/sports/08ohiostate-strauss01/merlin_164803371_fe51c921-cba9-4e45-b723-037b101435f4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/08/sports/08ohiostate-strauss01/merlin_164803371_fe51c921-cba9-4e45-b723-037b101435f4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/08/sports/08ohiostate-strauss01/merlin_164803371_fe51c921-cba9-4e45-b723-037b101435f4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption