asy if you’re not working. It’s not easy if you’re working or going to school, either. It’s not easy for any of us. The future’s still out there, mirage-like in the distance. Sometimes it looks promising — as if summer could bring normalcy, a haircut, a trip to the crowded farmers’ market, a swim at the beach, at the pond, at the rec-center pool in town. But it’s often the opposite. Fear’s like that: awful and menacing. There’s so much we don’t know, can’t know, can’t imagine.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/10/magazine/10-mag-eat-copy/10-mag-eat-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 452, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/10/magazine/10-mag-eat-copy/10-mag-eat-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 452}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/10/magazine/10-mag-eat-copy/10-mag-eat-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 771, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/10/magazine/10-mag-eat-copy/10-mag-eat-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1542, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/10/magazine/10-mag-eat-copy/10-mag-eat-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/10/magazine/10-mag-eat-copy/10-mag-eat-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/10/magazine/10-mag-eat-copy/10-mag-eat-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'widt