2-b83e-5720fb7676a8'}, {'abstract': 'News organizations have long hoped that tech platforms would pay them for news. Now regulators abroad are moving to make that happen.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/10/business/media/big-tech-has-crushed-the-news-business-thats-about-to-change.html', 'snippet': 'News organizations have long hoped that tech platforms would pay them for news. Now regulators abroad are moving to make that happen.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It reads like a coroner’s report on the news business, 623 pages filled with charts and graphs detailing the devastating decline in local news and public policy reporting of the past decade. It landed on the Australian prime minister’s desk last summer, unnoticed by most news consumers in America and around the world.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/11/business/05JP10BENSMITH-print/0510BENSMITH-sims-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/11/business/05JP10BENSMITH-print/0510BENSMITH-sims-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 404}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/11/business/05JP10BENSMITH-print/0510BENSMITH-sims-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 690, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/11/business/05JP10BENSMITH-print/0510BENSMITH-sims-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1380, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/11/business/05JP10BENSMITH-print/0510BENSMITH-sims-thumbStandard.jpg', 'hei