s lamb rolls seasoned with harissa, to serve whole or to slice as hors d’oeuvres. The pies and rolls are sold frozen for home baking. The bakery also offers grocery staples, including bread and pastry flours, and boxes of local produce.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/11Burner-pie/merlin_172245975_847de9e8-caa6-4af0-afc6-6951e0183a5b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 351, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/11Burner-pie/merlin_172245975_847de9e8-caa6-4af0-afc6-6951e0183a5b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 351}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/11Burner-pie/merlin_172245975_847de9e8-caa6-4af0-afc6-6951e0183a5b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 599, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/11Burner-pie/merlin_172245975_847de9e8-caa6-4af0-afc6-6951e0183a5b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1197, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/11Burner-pie/11Burner-pie-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/11Burner-pie/11Burner-pie-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/11Burner-pie/11Burner-pie-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 