th Avenue, whose Houston and San Antonio shops are the retailer’s only locations in the United States to resume normal business, as of Monday.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/fashion/12VIRUS-DEPTSHOPPING-SIDE-1/12VIRUS-DEPTSHOPPING-SIDE-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 901, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/14/fashion/12VIRUS-DEPTSHOPPING-SIDE-1/12VIRUS-DEPTSHOPPING-SIDE-1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 901}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/fashion/12VIRUS-DEPTSHOPPING-SIDE-1/12VIRUS-DEPTSHOPPING-SIDE-1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 682, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/fashion/12VIRUS-DEPTSHOPPING-SIDE-1/12VIRUS-DEPTSHOPPING-SIDE-1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1155, 'width': 769, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/fashion/12VIRUS-DEPTSHOPPING-SIDE-1/12VIRUS-DEPTSHOPPING-SIDE-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/14/fashion/12VIRUS-DEPTSHOPPING-SIDE-1/12VIRUS-DEPTSHOPPING-SIDE-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/fashion/12VIRUS-DEPTSHOPPING-SIDE-1/12VIRUS-DEPTSHOPPING-SIDE-1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'head