ontent_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Alternative Medicine: Acupuncture to Aid Indigestion', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACUPUNCTURE', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Digestive Tract', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-11T21:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Well', 'section_name': 'Well', 'subsection_name': 'Eat', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicholas Bakalar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicholas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bakalar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7920c3e0-532a-5469-aeef-0fab2476918c', 'word_count': 218, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7920c3e0-532a-5469-aeef-0fab2476918c'}, {'abstract': 'Websites help shoppers find mail-order cheeses, chocolates, farmers and purveyors.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/11/dining/food-shopping-online.html', 'snippet': 'Websites help shoppers find mail-order cheeses, chocolates, farmers and purveyors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Closed stores and restaurants are also taking a toll on parts of the food industry, like cheesemakers, as they lose the normal outlets for their perishable products. Your local cheese shop should be your first stop, but, on Janet Fletcher’s Planet Cheese website, there’s a national list of the cheesemakers and retailers that ship their products, a good resource for shoppers. Similarly, the Fine Chocolate Industry Association, whose members mostly offer bean-to-bar confections, has a list of chocolate makers that sell online at Make Mine Fine. Lastly, Good Food Media Network, which publishes a restaurant guide called Good Food 100 Restaurants, has created an umbrella website, updated weekly, that includes farms, purveyors like Island Creek Oysters, producers like Anson Mills and several wineries, and distributors.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/13Burner-List/merlin_146213451_2ddb9d95-3c81-46f6-b5a7-052da347f65c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/13Burner-List/merlin_146213451_2ddb9d95-3c81-46f6-b5a7-052da347f65c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/13Burner-List/merlin_146213451_2ddb9d95-3c81-46f6-b5a7-052da347f65c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/13Burner-List/merlin_146213451_2ddb9d95-3c81-46f6-b5a7-052da347f65c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/13Burner-List/merlin_146213451_2ddb9d95-3c81-46f6-b5a7-052da347f65c-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/13Burner-List/merlin_146213451_2ddb9d95-3c81-46f6-b5a7-052da347f65c-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/13Burner-List/merlin_146213451_2ddb9d95-3c81-46f6-b5a7-052da347f65c-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Chocolate and Cheese, if You Please', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Consult: Chocolate and Cheese, If You Please', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cheese', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chocolate', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fine Chocolate Industry Association', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Planet Cheese', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Good Food Media Network', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fletcher, Janet (1956- )', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quarantine (Life and Culture)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-11T21:08:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2c55e6e9-2f1a-5553-a294-c0205fc97ea4', 'word_count': 164, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2c55e6e9-2f1a-5553-a294-c0205fc97ea4'}, {'abstract': 'With theaters shuttered, a host of audio dramas and musicals have popped up, and actors are honing a skill: creating characters with just their voices.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/11/theater/broadway-actors-audio-dramas.html', 'snippet': 'With theaters shuttered, a host of audio dramas and musicals have popped up, and actors are honing a skill: creating characters with just their voices.', 'lead_paragraph': '“You have to make your voice do everything,” James Monroe Iglehart said. If you have seen Iglehart onstage — as the genie in “Aladdin,” say, or as Jefferson in “Hamilton” — you will have admired his nifty footwork and kinetic facial expressions. Those don’t matter now. In his apartment, in front of his “really expensive” microphone, he creates characters with vocals alone.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/arts/11broadway-voice-1/11broadway-voice-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 479, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/12/arts/11broadway-voice-1/11broadway-voice-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 479}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/arts/11broadway-voice-1/11broadway-voice-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 818, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/arts/11broadway-voice-1/11broadway-voice-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1636, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/arts/11broadway-voice-1/11broadway-voice-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/12/arts/11broadway-voice-1/11broadway-voice-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/arts/11broadway-voice-1/11broadway-voice-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For Your Ears Only: Broadway’s New Stage Is a Mic', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Broadway Adjusts Audio for New Stage', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Podcasts', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ashford, Annaleigh', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Iglehart, James Monroe', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jones, Rebecca Naomi', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "O'Hara, Kelli", 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Park, Ashley (Actor)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stiles, Sarah', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trensch, Taylor', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quarantine (Life and Culture)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-11T21:12:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alexis Soloski', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alexis', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Soloski', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/915a27b4-19bd-5211-9636-8bf80d7a698c', 'word_count': 1320, 'uri': 'nyt://article/915a27b4-19bd-5211-9636-8bf80d7a698c'}, {'abstract': 'Abasolo Ancestral Corn Whisky, made from nixtamalized corn, has a toasty aroma and some honeyed sweetness.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/11/dining/abasolo-ancestral-corn-whisky.html', 'snippet': 'Abasolo Ancestral Corn Whisky, made from nixtamalized corn, has a toasty aroma and some honeyed sweetness.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We appreciate tequila, have tried mezcal and are sampling sotol. Still there is more to learn about Mexican spirits. Corn whiskey, for example, is a rarity. But now there’s one that’s new. Abasolo, El Whisky de Mexico, from Jilotepec de Abasolo, just north of Mexico City, is made entirely from heritage corn that has undergone nixtamalization, like masa. The 86-proof spirit — made in copper pot stills and aged in oak — is pale gold, has a toasty aroma and some honeyed sweetness that tames the alcohol. It’s excellent with a splash of pineapple juice and a squeeze of lime. Through Aug. 1, the profits from sales are being donated to Another Round Another Rally, a nonprofit based in Phoenix that supports the hospitality industry.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/11burner-corn/merlin_172204347_fe934946-492d-4915-b7b3-3b24ab8fc09a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/11burner-corn/merlin_172204347_fe934946-492d-4915-b7b3-3b24ab8fc09a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/11burner-corn/merlin_172204347_fe934946-492d-4915-b7b3-3b24ab8fc09a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/11burner-corn/merlin_172204347_fe934946-492d-4915-b7b3-3b24ab8fc09a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/11burner-corn/11burner-corn-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/11burner-corn/11burner-corn-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/11burner-corn/11burner-corn-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Now From Mexico: Corn Whiskey', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Sip: Now From Mexico:  Corn Whiskey', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ALCOHOLIC BEVERAGES', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Whiskey', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mexico', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Casa Lumbre', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-11T21:15:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9c27fdcc-213e-540c-b8e2-cc2332a60c3c', 'word_count': 156, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9c27fdcc-213e-540c-b8e2-cc2332a60c3c'}, {'abstract': 'A new documentary, now available to stream, looks at the history and habitat of the delicacy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/11/dining/sea-urchin-film-the-delicacy.html', 'snippet': 'A new documentary, now available to stream, looks at the history and habitat of the delicacy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The story of the sea urchin, from ocean floor to the dinner plate, is the subject of this vibrant documentary that was released for streaming last week on Somm TV. With commentary from food celebrities like Andrew Zimmern and chefs like Kyle Connaughton, it follows the gourmand’s taste, from ancient times to the present, for the pentagonal gonads of the spiny creatures. It shows their habitat and how urchins off the coast of California are harvested.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/11Burner-Uni/merlin_172323429_f967cbc0-3816-430a-9540-aca128ac8ee0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/11Burner-Uni/merlin_172323429_f967cbc0-3816-430a-9540-aca128ac8ee0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/11Burner-Uni/merlin_172323429_f967cbc0-3816-430a-9540-aca128ac8ee0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/11Burner-Uni/merlin_172323429_f967cbc0-3816-430a-9540-aca128ac8ee0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/11Burner-Uni/merlin_172323429_f967cbc0-3816-430a-9540-aca128ac8ee0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/11Burner-Uni/merlin_172323429_f967cbc0-3816-430a-9540-aca128ac8ee0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/dining/11Burner-Uni/merlin_172323429_f967cbc0-3816-430a-9540-aca128ac8ee0-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'c