im by President Trump’s supporters that federal guidelines are coaching doctors to inflate the pandemic’s death toll misidentified the Fox-affiliated television station where Chris Berg as a host. It is West Dakota Fox, not KX4. While KX4 also carries Mr. Berg’s program, it is a CBS affiliate.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: May 12, 2020', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2020-05-12T02:27:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Corrections', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Correction', '_id': 'nyt://article/ccac3e9d-3ccb-536a-b34f-9e5713d7dfca', 'word_count': 367, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ccac3e9d-3ccb-536a-b34f-9e5713d7dfca'}, {'abstract': 'Snowbank, who will turn 7 in July, may have ventured out from Franklin Park Zoo in Boston in search of love.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/11/us/boston-peacock-mating-call.html', 'snippet': 'Snowbank, who will turn 7 in July, may have ventured out from Franklin Park Zoo in Boston in search of love.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The fugitive was wearing iridescent blue and green feathers when he was, for lack of a better word, spotted by a police officer in Boston.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/11/us/11xp-peacock1/11xp-peacock1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 516, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/11/us/11xp-peacock1/11xp-peacock1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 516}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/11/us/11xp-peacock1/11xp-peacock1-jumbo.jpg', 'he