yne (Jon Hamm), to rescue his second bunker of kidnapped girls. Similar to Netflix’s initial interactive episode of “Black Mirror: Bandersnatch,” this special will allow viewers to make choices with their remotes, steering the characters to different paths and story lines. Though the episode’s format is choose-your-own-adventure, this version will likely be significantly less dark than “Bandersnatch”; when viewer choices go awry, Kimmy’s talking backpack, Jan, will intervene to facilitate “do-overs.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/arts/12tvcol-kimmy/merlin_171936333_8652ea67-8bdf-4221-8a6e-9fad256a0fbd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/12/arts/12tvcol-kimmy/merlin_171936333_8652ea67-8bdf-4221-8a6e-9fad256a0fbd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/arts/12tvcol-kimmy/merlin_171936333_8652ea67-8bdf-4221-8a6e-9fad256a0fbd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/arts/12tvcol-kimmy/merlin_171936333_8652ea67-8bdf-4221-8a6e-9fad256a0fbd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/arts/12tvcol-kimmy/12tvcol-kimmy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/12/arts/12tvcol-kimmy/12tvcol-kimmy-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thu