g', 'section_name': 'The Learning Network', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Learning Network', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Learning Network'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5ccf8b3a-2385-556c-b8e1-5f57b351f84a', 'word_count': 251, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5ccf8b3a-2385-556c-b8e1-5f57b351f84a'}, {'abstract': 'Efforts to get back to business have been inconsistent and sometimes stricter than workers elsewhere might tolerate. Still, the country could set a path for the rest of the world.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/12/business/coronavirus-china-work-safety.html', 'snippet': 'Efforts to get back to business have been inconsistent and sometimes stricter than workers elsewhere might tolerate. Still, the country could set a path for the rest of the world.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BMW workers take their own temperature three times a day and submit the results via an internal chat app. Foxconn, the electronics giant, tells employees to wash their hands before and after handling documents. A ride-share driver wipes down his car daily and sends video proof to headquarters.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/business/12virus-china-work-1/merlin_172380309_98f227c9-fbcc-4024-899f-524334ebe45f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/12/business/12virus-china-work-1/merlin_172380309_98f227c9-fbcc-4024-899f-524334ebe45f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/business/12virus-china-work-1/merlin_172380309_98f227c9-fbcc-4024-899f-524334ebe45f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'su