as still livestreaming, they converted thousands of fans worldwide.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It has been a strange chain of events, the small group of soccer fans admits. One minute, the fans were searching for live sports to watch on television during the pandemic. The next, they found themselves building a passionate, worldwide following for a small-town Eastern European soccer team and, briefly, even trying to save it from financial ruin.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/sports/12soccer-belarus-1/12soccer-belarus-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 420, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/12/sports/12soccer-belarus-1/12soccer-belarus-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 420}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/sports/12soccer-belarus-1/12soccer-belarus-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 716, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/sports/12soccer-belarus-1/12soccer-belarus-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1433, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/sports/12soccer-belarus-1/12soccer-belarus-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/12/sports/12soccer-belarus-1/12soccer-belarus-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/sports/12soccer-belarus-1/12soccer-belarus-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How a Band of Australians Made Belarus Soccer an Internet Smash', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '9,000 Miles Away, Fans Turn  Tiny Club Into Global Smash', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'GoFundMe', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Belarus', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Australia', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-12T07:00:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Williams', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Williams', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b0ccc77a-b7a2-543a-9ee8-b53f1bd49db1', 'word_count': 895, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b0ccc77a-b7a2-543a-9ee8-b53f1bd49db1'}, {'abstract': '“The community has taken a tragedy and turned it into a superpower,” said an expert on using plasma to treat people after virus exposure.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/12/nyregion/virus-orthodox-plasma-donation.html', 'snippet': '“The community has taken a tragedy and turned it into a superpower,” said an expert on using plasma to treat people after virus exposure.', 'lead_paragraph': 'They came in waves throughout the day, large groups in car pools and married couples taking advantage of their newfound health for a road trip through the mountains of Eastern Pennsylvania.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype'