d ran two laundromats.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/12/obituaries/edith-richmond-dead-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'With an 8th-grade education, she emigrated to Brooklyn, where she invested her savings in real estate, rented out apartments and ran two laundromats.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This obituary is part of a series about people who have died in the coronavirus pandemic. Read about others here.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/obituaries/12Richemond/12Richemond-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 566, 'width': 443, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/obituaries/12Richemond/12Richemond-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 566, 'width': 443, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/obituaries/12Richemond/12Richemond-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/14/obituaries/12Richemond/12Richemond-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/obituaries/12Richemond/12Richemond-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Edith Richemond, a Haitian Bootstrap Success Story, Dies at 88', 'kicker': 'Those We’ve Lost', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Edith Richemond, 88', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject',