se Thursday night, as “How to Get Away With Murder” airs its final episode. In the penultimate episode, a high-stakes trial began — with Annalise representing herself. How will it end? In a video promoting the finale, the show’s creator, Peter Nowalk, cautioned audiences not to expect justice. “I would be a big liar if I told a story where everyone got what they deserved,” he said. “That’s not what happens in life.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/arts/14tvcol-howtogetaway/14tvcol-howtogetaway-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/14/arts/14tvcol-howtogetaway/14tvcol-howtogetaway-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/arts/14tvcol-howtogetaway/14tvcol-howtogetaway-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/arts/14tvcol-howtogetaway/14tvcol-howtogetaway-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/arts/14tvcol-howtogetaway/14tvcol-howtogetaway-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/14/arts/14tvcol-howtogetaway/14tvcol-howtogetaway-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/arts/14tvcol-howtogetaway/14