', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How Do You Maintain Dignity for the Dead in a Pandemic?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Farenga Brothers Funeral Home (Bronx, NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Funerals and Memorials', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cremation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cemeteries', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Death and Dying', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bronx (NYC)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-14T09:00:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Philip Montgomery and Maggie Jones', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Philip', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Montgomery', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Maggie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jones', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d3c4dc57-b744-58aa-b5b2-7f7e72788906', 'word_count': 3758, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d3c4dc57-b744-58aa-b5b2-7f7e72788906'}, {'abstract': 'A fourth region of upstate New York has met the criteria to start gradually reopening, the governor said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/14/nyregion/coronavirus-nyc.html', 'snippet': 'A fourth region of upstate New York has met the criteria to start gradually reopening, the governor said.', 'lead_paragraph': ' [Want to get New York Today by email? Here’s the sign-up.]', 'source': 'The New 