es/blood-and-money-review-a-deer-hunt-turns-cat-and-mouse.html', 'snippet': 'Tom Berenger stars in this creaky survival thriller.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jim Reed (Tom Berenger), the primary, barely moving part of the backcountry thriller “Blood and Money,” is not a well man. A retired U.S. Marine whose alcoholism has him coughing blood and wheezing every few steps, Jim subsists on cigarettes, peanut-butter sandwiches and an array of medications. Not your typical action hero, you might think, and you’d be right; but that doesn’t stop Berenger and his director, John Barr, from spending the next hour and a half trying to prove otherwise.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/arts/blood1/merlin_172328754_90736043-304a-4584-856b-a10a229eb95e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 297, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/12/arts/blood1/merlin_172328754_90736043-304a-4584-856b-a10a229eb95e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 297}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/arts/blood1/merlin_172328754_90736043-304a-4584-856b-a10a229eb95e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 507, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/arts/blood1/merlin_172328754_90736043-304a-4584-856b-a10a229eb95e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1013, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/12/arts/blood1/blood1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'imag