criptions over advertising revenue.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/14/business/media/quartz-to-lay-off-80-employees.html', 'snippet': 'Nearly half the employees at the international business news site will lose their jobs as the eight-year-old outlet emphasizes paid subscriptions over advertising revenue.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Quartz, a business news site with offices around the world, is laying off nearly half its staff in a substantial restructuring after the economic fallout of the coronavirus pandemic drastically cut into its advertising revenue.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/business/14Virus-Quartz-01/merlin_172487586_d25ddd62-1366-4c0b-8ef4-2654710cce1c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/14/business/14Virus-Quartz-01/merlin_172487586_d25ddd62-1366-4c0b-8ef4-2654710cce1c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/business/14Virus-Quartz-01/merlin_172487586_d25ddd62-1366-4c0b-8ef4-2654710cce1c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/business/14Virus-Quartz-01/merlin_172487586_d25ddd62-1366-4c0b-8ef4-2654710cce1c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/business/14Virus-Quartz-01/14Virus-Quartz-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/14/business/14