nyt://article/57c93da7-d199-5211-96f7-575e3ac542af', 'word_count': 1077, 'uri': 'nyt://article/57c93da7-d199-5211-96f7-575e3ac542af'}, {'abstract': 'Lawmakers are just like the millions of other people who are working from home.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/15/opinion/virus-congress-remote-voting.html', 'snippet': 'Lawmakers are just like the millions of other people who are working from home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This month, in a long overdue change, the Senate finally started holding hybrid hearings, allowing both senators and health experts to appear via videoconferencing as well as in the Senate chamber. This occurred months after other public and private organizations all over the world had already made the transition to remote work. Just last week, the House majority leader introduced rule changes, passed on Friday, allowing the House to follow suit by permitting both remote hearings and remote voting.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/15/opinion/15wolff/15wolff-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/15/opinion/15wolff/15wolff-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/15/opinion/15wolff/15wolff-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/15/opinion/15wolff/15wolff-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/15/opinion/15wolff/1