ics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment Insurance', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus Aid, Relief, and Economic Security Act (2020)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-15T09:00:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Upshot', 'section_name': 'The Upshot', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neil Irwin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Irwin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9f8ef73c-2f12-585b-82b7-683920150fa6', 'word_count': 1067, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9f8ef73c-2f12-585b-82b7-683920150fa6'}, {'abstract': 'The great outdoors can be made a little smaller for a close-to-home adventure.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/15/smarter-living/this-summer-consider-camping-in-your-own-backyard.html', 'snippet': 'The great outdoors can be made a little smaller for a close-to-home adventure.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Our kids are going to have the weirdest memories of this time, and, ideally, some of them will be beautiful. Or at least comedic. This is where backyard camping comes in. Think s’mores, stars, the air mattress deflating with a cartoony hiss. Picture your children’s faces, fire-lit and, for just another minute, little. It could happen in farmland, suburbia or the Bronx — and it could be lovely. (And if you don’t have access to the outdoors, consider adapting these tips for the middle of your tiny apartment’s living room.)', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/17/smarter-living/13virus-backyard-campin