ng on his age and his past comments on China.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/15/us/politics/trump-ads-joe-biden.html', 'snippet': 'President Trump’s re-election team has launched a long-promised barrage of negative ads against Joseph R. Biden Jr., focusing on his age and his past comments on China.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The negative ads attacking Joseph R. Biden Jr. on Facebook pages and television screens are as relentless as they are varied, as if plucked from a vintage Trump rally rant: Some make unfounded inferences about his mental state, saying “geriatric health is no laughing matter.” Others paint the presumptive Democratic nominee as “China’s puppet.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/us/politics/00trumpads/merlin_172205088_903be750-a53f-40fd-9809-4ad4bb04c636-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/14/us/politics/00trumpads/merlin_172205088_903be750-a53f-40fd-9809-4ad4bb04c636-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/us/politics/00trumpads/merlin_172205088_903be750-a53f-40fd-9809-4ad4bb04c636-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/us/politics/00trumpads/merlin_172205088_903be750-a53f-40fd-9809-4ad4bb04c636-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/us/politics/00trumpads/00trumpads-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 