sualty amid retail closures tied to the coronavirus pandemic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/15/business/jc-penney-bankruptcy-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'The chain’s move came after J. Crew and the Neiman Marcus Group filed, and represented the biggest casualty amid retail closures tied to the coronavirus pandemic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'J.C. Penney, with its budget-friendly clothing for families and reliable home furnishings, was for years a cornerstone of American malls and an undeniable success story. What started as a humble dry goods store in Wyoming in 1902 was a century later a national chain with a household name and more than 1,000 locations.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/16/business/15virus-jcpenney-print/merlin_172533633_1f85fa46-7b89-4905-9f99-9da82c32c567-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 486, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/16/business/15virus-jcpenney-print/merlin_172533633_1f85fa46-7b89-4905-9f99-9da82c32c567-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 486}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/16/business/15virus-jcpenney-print/merlin_172533633_1f85fa46-7b89-4905-9f99-9da82c32c567-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 829, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/16/business/15virus-jcpenney-print/merlin_172533633_1f85fa46-7b89-4905-9f99-9da82c32c567-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1658, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/16/business/15virus-jcpenney-print/15