r 23 years, since he was indicted by the International Criminal Tribunal for Rwanda on multiple charges of genocide.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/16/world/europe/france-rwanda-genocide-kabuga.html', 'snippet': 'Félicien Kabuga, 84, had been on the run for 23 years, since he was indicted by the International Criminal Tribunal for Rwanda on multiple charges of genocide.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — He was behind the radio station whose hate-filled invectives turned Rwandan against Rwandan, neighbor against neighbor, even spouse against spouse. He was the man, it was said, who imported the hundreds of thousands of machetes that allowed countless ordinary people to act upon that hatred in one of the last genocides of the past century.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/17/world/17rwanda/merlin_172549857_fadb7232-8752-4195-94dc-ff3ed72c8279-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 390, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/17/world/17rwanda/merlin_172549857_fadb7232-8752-4195-94dc-ff3ed72c8279-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 390}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/17/world/17rwanda/merlin_172549857_fadb7232-8752-4195-94dc-ff3ed72c8279-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 666, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/17/world/17rwanda/merlin_172549857_fadb7232-8752-4195-94dc-ff3ed72c8279-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1331, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/17/world/17rwanda/16rw