: 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/16/us/obama-hbcu-speech-transcript.html', 'snippet': 'Former President Barack Obama addressed a ceremony for graduates of historically black colleges and universities. Here is what he had to say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Former President Barack Obama gave the virtual commencement address at a ceremony for graduates of historically black colleges and universities on Saturday. The two-hour event, “Show Me Your Walk H.B.C.U. Edition,” celebrated more than 27,000 students from 78 schools.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/16/us/16virus-obama-hbcu-transcrip-promo/16virus-obama-hbcu-transcrip-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/16/us/16virus-obama-hbcu-transcrip-promo/16virus-obama-hbcu-transcrip-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/16/us/16virus-obama-hbcu-transcrip-promo/16virus-obama-hbcu-transcrip-promo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/16/us/16virus-obama-hbcu-transcrip-promo/16virus-obama-hbcu-transcrip-promo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/16/us/16virus-obama-hbcu-transcrip-promo/16virus-obama-hbcu-transcrip-promo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/16/us/16virus-obama-hbcu-transcrip-promo/16virus-obama-hbcu-transcri