ng career but won acclaim for a freewheeling style that made room for contributions from actors like Marc Maron, who survives her.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/16/obituaries/lynn-shelton-dead.html', 'snippet': 'She got a late start on her filmmaking career but won acclaim for a freewheeling style that made room for contributions from actors like Marc Maron, who survives her.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lynn Shelton, the acclaimed director of “Humpday,” “Sword of Trust” and numerous other independent films, died on Friday at a hospital in Los Angeles. She was 54.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/19/arts/16shelton-obit1/merlin_172566171_d98164a5-68c3-4fdc-bb87-944ad366b676-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 902, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/19/arts/16shelton-obit1/merlin_172566171_d98164a5-68c3-4fdc-bb87-944ad366b676-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 902}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/19/arts/16shelton-obit1/merlin_172566171_d98164a5-68c3-4fdc-bb87-944ad366b676-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 682, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/19/arts/16shelton-obit1/merlin_172566171_d98164a5-68c3-4fdc-bb87-944ad366b676-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1363, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/19/arts/16shelton-obit1/16shelton-obit1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/19/arts/16shelton-obit1/16shelton-obit1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/19/arts/16shelton-obit1/16shelton-obit1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Lynn Shelton, Director of Intimate Comic Dramas, Dies at 54', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lynn Shelton, 54, Who Directed Freewheeling Independent Films', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shelton, Lynn', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Humpday (Movie)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Sword of Trust (Movie)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-16T21:40:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Obituaries', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jason Bailey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jason', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bailey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/76520f88-cdd7-567b-bdea-73f618b32c68', 'word_count': 705, 'uri': 'nyt://article/76520f88-cdd7-567b-bdea-73f618b32c68'}, {'abstract': 'A look back at the writer and director’s films, and where to watch them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/16/movies/lynn-shelton-movie-moments.html', 'snippet': 'A look back at the writer and director’s films, and where to watch them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The writer and director Lynn Shelton, who in the last decade emerged as a strong voice in contemporary American independent film, has died at the age of 54. Her film