zation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-18T04:01:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8f6649a1-2a9f-552a-8319-4ca37f45fdc9', 'word_count': 4618, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8f6649a1-2a9f-552a-8319-4ca37f45fdc9'}, {'abstract': "These times are terrible. Why not read about a few things that aren't?", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2020/05/18/style/the-joy-of.html', 'snippet': "These times are terrible. Why not read about a few things that aren't?", 'lead_paragraph': "These times are terrible. Why not read about a few things that aren't?", 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '14 Ways We’re Finding Joy (in Spite of Everything)', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Instagram Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brodesser-Akner, Taffy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wortham, Jenna', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-18T04:04:23+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Style', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/d68de6d6-9c98-5fcb-b438-0b97158aab16', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/d68de6d6-9c98-5fcb-b438-0b97158aab16'}, {'abstract': 'It started with a mask.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/18/style/caring-joy.html', 'snippet': 'It started with a mask.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A month or so back, at the beginning of mask wearing out here in Bloomington, Ind., I was taking a walk and a friend pulled up in her little Toyota pickup truck. We chatted a bit from a distance (we usually hug, so many friends, so many beloveds we no longer touch, that touching being one of the ways we know each other, a sensorium bereft, and let us figure out how to mourn this properly), and then she told me she was on her way to drop off some masks she’d made for her nephew, who’s about my age, at the jail. ', 'print_section': 'TP', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/18/fashion/18joy-caring/18joy-caring-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 273, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/18/fashion/18joy-caring/18joy-caring-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 273}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/18/fashion/18joy-caring/18joy-caring-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 467, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/18/fashion/18joy-caring/18joy-caring-superJumbo.gif', 'height': 1080, 'width': 1920, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/18/fashion/18joy-caring/18joy-caring-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/18/fashion/18joy-caring/18joy-caring-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/18/fashion/18joy-caring/18joy-caring-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main':