hree million dropped out of the labor force in the past month. Combined that’s nearly one in three young workers, by far the highest rate since the country started tracking unemployment by age in 1948.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/18/opinion/18omara1/18omara1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 471, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/18/opinion/18omara1/18omara1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 471}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/18/opinion/18omara1/18omara1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 803, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/18/opinion/18omara1/18omara1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1606, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/18/opinion/18omara1/18omara1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/18/opinion/18omara1/18omara1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/18/opinion/18omara1/18omara1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '7.7 Million Young People Are Unemployed. We Need a New ‘Tree Army.’', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Unemployment', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Volunteers and Community Service', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Youth', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Forests and Forestry', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'National Parks, Monuments and Seashores', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Corp for National and Community Service', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Roosevelt, Franklin Delano', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-18T09:00:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': "By Collin O'Mara", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Collin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "O'Mara", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/5b009061-f377-54d6-a50f-4926a1d97d6d', 'word_count': 737, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5b009061-f377-54d6-a50f-4926a1d97d6d'}, {'abstract': 'Plus, the road to women’s suffrage, finding a new normal and more live Times events this week.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/18/arts/join-us-for-a-moment-of-calm-with-jameela-jamil.html', 'snippet': 'Plus, the road to women’s suffrage, finding a new normal and more live Times events this week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The coronavirus has transformed nearly every aspect of daily life, but Times journalists are here to keep you informed and connected from home. Below is a selection of our live events this week (all times are Eastern). You can find the full calendar here.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/18/lens/18virtual-events-roundup-03/18virtual-even