 more pesticide per acre than farmers do. But we can change what we do in our own yards.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/18/opinion/lawn-pesticides-insect-extinction.html', 'snippet': 'Homeowners use up 10 times more pesticide per acre than farmers do. But we can change what we do in our own yards.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NASHVILLE — One day last fall, deep in the middle of a devastating drought, I was walking the dog when a van bearing the logo of a mosquito-control company blew past me and parked in front of a neighbor’s house. The whole vehicle stank of chemicals, even going 40 miles an hour.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/18/opinion/18reenklWeb/merlin_172588689_d56fee67-435b-44bf-91a8-254ba28fab2d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 429, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/18/opinion/18reenklWeb/merlin_172588689_d56fee67-435b-44bf-91a8-254ba28fab2d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 429}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/18/opinion/18reenklWeb/merlin_172588689_d56fee67-435b-44bf-91a8-254ba28fab2d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 731, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/18/opinion/18reenklWeb/merlin_172588689_d56fee67-435b-44bf-91a8-254ba28fab2d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1463, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/18/opinion/18reenklWeb/18reenklWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/18/opinion/1