stice Department', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Durham, John H', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Bureau of Investigation', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Herdman, Justin E', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shea, Timothy J (1960- )', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Flynn, Michael T', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-18T16:12:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katie Benner and Adam Goldman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Benner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goldman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/58bcd69b-c289-5daa-ac2a-0fbd590965a7', 'word_count': 1140, 'uri': 'nyt://article/58bcd69b-c289-5daa-ac2a-0fbd590965a7'}, {'abstract': 'The frozen desserts from Nick Morgenstern can now be sent to 48 states.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/18/dining/morgensterns-ice-cream-delivery.html', 'snippet': 'The frozen desserts from Nick Morgenstern can now be sent to 48 states.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nick Morgenstern, the high-profile ice cream specialist, with locations on West Houston Street and on Rivington Street in Manhattan, is expanding his footprint nationwide. This week, Morgenstern’s Finest Ice Cream will be available for shipping to 48 states. (Alaska and Hawaii are excluded.) Pints in classic flavors, like cookies and cream and butter pecan, or more offbeat selections, like green tea-pistachio, are available ($99 to $104 for four, $139 for six), as are six-packs of ice cream sandwiches ($89) and ice cream cakes ($119 to serve at least eight), delivery included.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/20/dining/18burner-cream/18burner-cream-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/20/dining/18burner-cream/18burner-cream-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/20/dining/18burner-cream/18burner-cream-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/20/dining/18burner-cream/18burner-cream-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/20/dining/18burner-cream/18burner-cream-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/20/dining/18burner-cream/18burner-cream-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/20/dining/18burner-cream/18burner-cream-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Morgenstern’s Ice Cream Now Ships Nationally', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Scoop: Morgenstern’s Ice Cream  Now Ships Nationally', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ice Cream and Frozen Desserts', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Morgenstern's Finest Ice Cream (Manhattan, NY)", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-18T16:17:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cdf37e85-ad87-5379-ad19-7fbd28ed6db6', 'word_count': 121, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cdf37e85-ad87-5379-ad19-7fbd28ed6db6'}, {'abstract': 'A new cookbook highlights the seasonal recipes of western Massachusetts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/18/dining/berkshires-farm-table-cookbook.html', 'snippet': 'A new cookbook highlights the seasonal recipes of western Massachusetts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Profiles of farmers and their farms in Western Massachusetts and other nearby areas fill “The Berkshires Farm Table Cookbook.” Springtime lingers in this simple, approachable book, with an egg on a bed of fava beans, peas, garlic scapes and zucchini; summer shines, in a handsome casserole of eggplant with tomatoes and mozzarella, and a pizza topped with fresh Greek salad. Easy carrot soup with sage and mint, white bean dip, and cauliflower with cheese are evergreens. And it’s not all about vegetables and fruit; some of the farms featured raise livestock and make cheese, and seafood recipes are included. A sampling of the farms might be familiar to New York Greenmarket shoppers.  And Blue Hill Farm, owned by the chef Dan Barber’s family, makes an appearance, and a few restaurants and inns are represented.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type'