Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Shira Ovide', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Shira', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ovide', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/896c70cf-cab3-52f3-8526-020d0b9bfe52', 'word_count': 1005, 'uri': 'nyt://article/896c70cf-cab3-52f3-8526-020d0b9bfe52'}, {'abstract': 'Judith Norell, an owner of the Upper West Side bakery, teaches classes online, with proceeds going to health care workers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/18/dining/silver-moon-baking-classes.html', 'snippet': 'Judith Norell, an owner of the Upper West Side bakery, teaches classes online, with proceeds going to health care workers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For Judith Norell, an owner of Silver Moon Bakery on the Upper West Side, cooking classes are a recent side business. She has started a series of weekly Zoom sessions on Tuesdays, charging a minimal optional fee and will use the funds to provide treats for health care and other emergency workers in the neighborhood. The series, starting with challah, begins Tuesday, and the recipes, along with the list of ingredients and other necessary materials, are provided to those who sign up. Next up for May 26 is a simple rhubarb tart.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/20/dining/18burner-bake/18burner-bake-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 473, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/20/dining/18burner-bake/18burner-bake-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 473}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/20/dining/18burner-bake/18burner-bake-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 807, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/20/dining/18burner-bake/18burner-bake-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1613, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/20/dining/18burner-bake/18burner-bake-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/20/dining/18burner-bake/18burner-bake-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/20/dining/18burner-bake/18burner-bake-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Learn Some of the Recipes From Silver Moon Bakery', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Zoom: Learn a Dish And Provide a Treat', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bakeries and Baked Products', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Silver Moon Bakery (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADULT EDUCATION', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quarantine (Life and Culture)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-18T16:33:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/691a6233-0ebc-5909-934d-beb9f0559384', 'word_count': 132, 'uri': 'nyt://article/691a6233-0ebc-5909-934d-beb9f0559384'}, {'abstract': 'A storied actor, he starred opposite Brigitte Bardot and Catherine Deneuve and worked with many of the giants of European filmmaking.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/18/obituaries/michel-piccoli-star-of-french-stage-and-screen-dies-at-94.html', 'snippet': 'A storied actor, he starred opposite Brigitte Bardot and Catherine Deneuve and worked with many of the giants of European filmmaking.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Michel Piccoli, an actor whose quiet intensity and mature sensuality made him a fixture of French cinema for more than a half-century, died on May 12, it was announced on Monday. He was 94.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/19/world/00piccoli1/merlin_172607235_5804da56-4896-4271-983c-dc68c6d05604-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/19/world/00piccoli1/merlin_172607235_5804da56-4896-4271-983c-dc68c6d05604-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/19/world/00piccoli1/merlin_172607235_5804da56-4896-4271-983c-dc68c6d05604-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/19/world/00piccoli1/merlin_172607235_5804da56-4896-4271-983c-dc68c6d05604-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1369, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/19/world/00piccoli1/00piccoli1-thumbStandard.j