c Forces Conference Planners to Start Over', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Conventions, Fairs and Trade Shows', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hotels and Travel Lodgings', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hilton Worldwide Holdings Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hyatt Hotels Corp', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Marriott International Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quarantine (Life and Culture)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-18T20:32:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Martha C. White', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Martha', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'White', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/335f4cd3-ede3-5625-86ff-f96d6eff6d0e', 'word_count': 1447, 'uri': 'nyt://article/335f4cd3-ede3-5625-86ff-f96d6eff6d0e'}, {'abstract': 'The pandemic marginalized the far right, as Germans rallied behind Angela Merkel. But the reopening has brought them back, and they are preparing to seize new opportunities.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/18/world/europe/coronavirus-germany-far-right.html', 'snippet': 'The pandemic marginalized the far right, as Germans rallied behind Angela Merkel. But the reopening has brought them back, and they are preparing to seize new opportunities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BERLIN — Outside Germany’s Parliament building, a vegan celebrity cook grabbed the mic and shouted that he was “ready to die” to stop self-serving elites from using the pandemic to topple the world order. Some distance away, a group of women discussed how Bill Gates was plotting to force immunization on the population. Youngsters sporting cardboard cutouts of the German constitution chanted: “End the corona dictatorship!” Few wore masks, and those that did came with slogans like “Merkel’s muzzle.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/18/world/18virus-germany-farright2/merlin_172580733_ea7fea6f-4b24-4a0c-b8dc-cd5a7de6312d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/18/world/18virus-germany-farright2/merlin_172580733_ea7fea6f-4b24-4a0c-b8dc-cd5a7de6312d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/18/world/18virus-germany-farright2/merlin_172580733_ea7fea6f-4b24-4a0c-b8dc-cd5a7de6312d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/18/world/18virus-germany-farright2/merlin_172580733_ea7fea6f-4b24-4a0c-b8dc-cd5a7de6312d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/18/world/18virus-germany-farright2/merlin_172580733_ea7fea6f-4b24-4a0c-b8dc-cd5a7de6312d-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/18/world/18virus-germany-farright2/merlin_172580733_ea7fea6f-4b24-4a0c-b8dc-cd5a7de6312d-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', '