any of Amazon’s others after missing early opportunities to protect workers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Therese Kelly arrived for her shift at an Amazon warehouse on March 27 to find her co-workers standing clustered in the cavernous space. They were awaiting a buildingwide announcement, a rarity at the complex known as AVP1. Over a loudspeaker, a manager told them what they had feared: For the first time, an employee had tested positive for the coronavirus.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/08/business/00virus-amazon5/merlin_172183539_9aabe2ea-2d6b-4000-a0a9-1b1cb8c69a9c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/08/business/00virus-amazon5/merlin_172183539_9aabe2ea-2d6b-4000-a0a9-1b1cb8c69a9c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/08/business/00virus-amazon5/merlin_172183539_9aabe2ea-2d6b-4000-a0a9-1b1cb8c69a9c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/08/business/00virus-amazon5/merlin_172183539_9aabe2ea-2d6b-4000-a0a9-1b1cb8c69a9c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/08/business/00virus-amazon5/00virus-amazon5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/08/business/00virus-amazon5/00virus-amazon5-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/08/business/00virus-amazon5/00virus-amazon5-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Way Too Late’: Inside Amazon’s Biggest Outbreak', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Amazon Sees Rise in Orders And Infection', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Workplace Hazards and Violations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMAZON.COM INC', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hazleton (Pa)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Commerce', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-19T09:00:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Weise', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Weise', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/72fd0938-6e1c-5b00-a279-4656432ab0de', 'word_count': 1493, 'uri': 'nyt://article/72fd0938-6e1c-5b00-a279-4656432ab0de'}, {'abstract': 'Time to add some these to your routine.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/19/well/three-stretches-to-tend-to-the-aches-and-pains-of-working-from-home.html', 'snippet': 'Time to add some these to your routine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On March 16, Nancy Black left her office for what she thought would be the last time. On March 19, however, she was back and ready to pilfer (with permission) parts of her office workstation. Dr. Black is an associate professor in the department of mechanical engineering at the Université de Moncton in Canada, specializing in ergonomics. In three days it was clear her home office was not going to meet her standards. So she came back and got her desktop computer, a large monitor and a desktop sit-to-stand apparatus, which lets her toggle between sitting and standing. Now she’s working from home pain-free, which is more than most of us can say as we toil away on tiny computers, sitting in our sweatpants on rigid kitchen chairs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/smarter-living/00sl-ergonomic-promo/00sl-ergonomic-promo-articleLarge.png', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/14/smarter-living/00sl-ergonomic-promo/00sl-ergonomic-promo-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/smarter-living/00sl-ergonomic-promo/00sl-ergonomic-promo-jumbo.png', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/smarter-living/00sl-ergonomic-promo/00sl-ergonomic-promo-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/14/smarter-living/00sl-ergonomic-promo/00sl-ergonomic-promo-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/14/smarter-living/00sl-ergonomic-promo/00sl-ergonomic-promo-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 7