562ae-c1e0-5af2-919b-e906e9fbc070'}, {'abstract': 'In March, the Pentagon announced restrictions on movements for service members and their families because of the coronavirus, upending plans for some in the middle of relocating.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/19/magazine/military-travel-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'In March, the Pentagon announced restrictions on movements for service members and their families because of the coronavirus, upending plans for some in the middle of relocating.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Maureen Elias expected her family’s final move with the military to come as a relief. She and her husband, Dustin, purchased a house in Oakton, Va., where the Army was transferring them from California for Dustin’s final assignment as he neared the end of his 20-year career. They expected to be on the East Coast by April 1, just in time to close on their dream home.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/19/magazine/19atwar-militaryfamilies/19atwar-militaryfamilies-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/19/magazine/19atwar-militaryfamilies/19atwar-militaryfamilies-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/19/magazine/19atwar-militaryfamilies/19atwar-militaryfamilies-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 637, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/19/magazine/19atwar-militaryfamilies/19atwar-militaryfamilies-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 637, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, '