s from China, Russia and the European Union chided Mr. Trump over his heated threats.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/19/us/politics/trump-who-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'The outcome left the United States isolated as officials from China, Russia and the European Union chided Mr. Trump over his heated threats.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Trump’s angry demands for punitive action against the World Health Organization were rebuffed on Tuesday by the organization’s other member nations, which decided instead to conduct an “impartial, independent” examination of the W.H.O.’s response to the coronavirus pandemic.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/19/us/politics/19dc-who1/merlin_172612845_c0521a09-e036-46c1-886b-f316bcca9fff-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/19/us/politics/19dc-who1/merlin_172612845_c0521a09-e036-46c1-886b-f316bcca9fff-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/19/us/politics/19dc-who1/merlin_172612845_c0521a09-e036-46c1-886b-f316bcca9fff-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/19/us/politics/19dc-who1/merlin_172612845_c0521a09-e036-46c1-886b-f316bcca9fff-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/19/us/politics/19dc-who1/19dc-who1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail'