27755b095', 'word_count': 1323, 'uri': 'nyt://article/94b8d606-efe0-5bc5-ac10-c6127755b095'}, {'abstract': 'The political fights around a malaria drug that President Trump says he takes daily have impeded studies into whether it works to prevent coronavirus infection or treat Covid-19 early.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/19/us/politics/hydroxychloroquine-trump-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'The political fights around a malaria drug that President Trump says he takes daily have impeded studies into whether it works to prevent coronavirus infection or treat Covid-19 early.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Trump’s enthusiastic embrace of a malaria drug that he now says he takes daily — and the resulting uproar in the news media — appears to be interfering with legitimate scientific research into whether the medicine might work to prevent coronavirus infection or treat the disease in its early stages.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/19/us/politics/19dc-virus-drug/merlin_171795282_8a53a75e-a826-48c9-8e9b-f2c1d89dc549-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 412, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/19/us/politics/19dc-virus-drug/merlin_171795282_8a53a75e-a826-48c9-8e9b-f2c1d89dc549-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 412}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/19/us/politics/19dc-virus-drug/merlin_171795282_8a53a75e-a826-48c9-8e9b-f2c1d89dc549-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 703, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/19/us/politics/19dc-virus-drug/merlin_171795282_8a53a75e-a826-48c9-8e9b-f2c1d89dc549-superJumbo.jp