 need to go, or who they might need to see.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Paper Dolls for Your Crafting Pleasure', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Home Crafts; Playing Dress Up', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dolls', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'James, Aurora', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stout, Katie', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-20T16:55:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katherine Cusumano', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katherine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cusumano', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a2fee224-cc53-5a06-b220-5073dbf4d483', 'word_count': 392, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a2fee224-cc53-5a06-b220-5073dbf4d483'}, {'abstract': 'Large-scale gatherings are on hold for the foreseeable future. That is taking a toll on the live events industry and society at large.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/20/business/public-gathering-events-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'Large-scale gatherings are on hold for the foreseeable future. That is taking a toll on the live events industry and society at large.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A quandary is lurking at the heart of the efforts to revive the economy.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/21/business/21virus-gathering-1/merlin_153829236_2420796d-160f-4b6e-b009-500e9f5829a5-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlar