ronavirus-cdc-report.html', 'snippet': 'Investigations require the careful management of egos, relationships and history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The babies turned blue and gasped for air. Cocooned inside incubators in an Arizona neonatal intensive-care unit, the preemies were sick with whooping cough, having contracted the infection somewhere between the maternity ward and the NICU. It was 2011, I was an officer in the Epidemic Intelligence Service at the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention, and it was my job to investigate the NICU epidemic and stop its spread.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/20/opinion/20Yasmin/20Yasmin-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 890, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/20/opinion/20Yasmin/20Yasmin-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 890}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/20/opinion/20Yasmin/20Yasmin-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 690, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/20/opinion/20Yasmin/20Yasmin-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1380, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/20/opinion/20Yasmin/20Yasmin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/20/opinion/20Yasmin/20Yasmin-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/20