his life up in the classifieds and has a series of misadventures.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/21/books/review-life-for-sale-yukio-mishima.html', 'snippet': 'In “Life for Sale,” a young copywriter fails at suicide, offers his life up in the classifieds and has a series of misadventures.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Like many great and prolific writers, Yukio Mishima divided his time. His best novels, including the Sea of Fertility tetralogy, were sweeping works tinged with his nationalist right-wing politics but also full of universal profundity. These are the types of books that made him a three-time nominee for the Nobel Prize in Literature.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/books/13BOOKMISHIMA1/13BOOKMISHIMA1-articleLarge.png', 'height': 848, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/13/books/13BOOKMISHIMA1/13BOOKMISHIMA1-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 848}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/books/13BOOKMISHIMA1/13BOOKMISHIMA1-jumbo.png', 'height': 1024, 'width': 725, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/books/13BOOKMISHIMA1/13BOOKMISHIMA1-superJumbo.png', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1450, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/13/books/13BOOKMISHIMA1/13BOOKMISHIMA1-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/13/books/13BOOKMISHIMA1/13BOOKMISHIMA1-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank'