ri': 'nyt://article/6a3be3d6-d085-5616-bb1e-848d7b7973ae'}, {'abstract': 'It has been decreed: The author of the ‘Selection’ series has another best seller.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/21/books/review/the-betrothed-kiera-cass.html', 'snippet': 'It has been decreed: The author of the ‘Selection’ series has another best seller.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IN SICKNESS AND IN HEALTH “My soul is 17,” says Kiera Cass, whose latest novel, “The Betrothed,” is No. 1 on the young adult hardcover list. “I feel like if I attempted to write an adult book, it would fail miserably because I couldn’t get the voice or tone right. But writing from a young adult perspective feels incredibly natural. Thinking about the first of something — your first love, your first heartbreak, your first time learning and trying so many things, it’s just so exciting to me.”', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '64', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/books/review/31insidethelist/31insidethelist-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/31/books/review/31insidethelist/31insidethelist-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/books/review/31insidethelist/31insidethelist-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/books/review/31insidethelist/31insidethelist-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/books/rev