ole': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Annie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Karni', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ef8504d2-087d-5379-8022-a9a3049316d5', 'word_count': 1173, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ef8504d2-087d-5379-8022-a9a3049316d5'}, {'abstract': 'As a hospice chaplain, I know that the path through grief is mourning. Music can meet us on the path and help us keep walking.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/21/well/mind/music-grief-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'As a hospice chaplain, I know that the path through grief is mourning. Music can meet us on the path and help us keep walking.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If we’re going to survive this pandemic we need music, more than ever. There is nothing else that can meet us in our heartbreak, elevate our spirits, move us to laughter and let us dream in the way that music can.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/18/well/well-voices-music/merlin_171069525_cf252c15-2e84-4a37-b937-a3188a42da63-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/18/well/well-voices-music/merlin_171069525_cf252c15-2e84-4a37-b937-a3188a42da63-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/18/well/well-voices-music/merlin_171069525_cf252c15-2e84-4a37-b937-a3188a42da63-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/18/well/well-voices-music/merlin_171069525_cf252c15-2e84-4a37-b937-a3188a42da63-superJumbo.jpg