cle/4ca0fc96-bbf5-51af-85c6-d38d7f2f87c2'}, {'abstract': 'Stop asking pundits to predict the future after the coronavirus. It doesn’t exist.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/22/opinion/sunday/coronavirus-prediction-future.html', 'snippet': 'Stop asking pundits to predict the future after the coronavirus. It doesn’t exist.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The best prophet, Thomas Hobbes once wrote, is the best guesser. That would seem to be the last word on our capacity to predict the future: We can’t.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/25/opinion/sunday/25lilla/24lilla-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 837, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/25/opinion/sunday/25lilla/24lilla-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 837}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/25/opinion/sunday/25lilla/24lilla-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 735, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/25/opinion/sunday/25lilla/24lilla-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1469, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/25/opinion/sunday/25lilla/24lilla-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/25/opinion/sunday/25lilla/24lilla-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/25/opinion/sunday/25