ove Photos From Facebook Tests Privacy Law', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Internet Privacy  And Family Rift  Collide in Case  In Netherlands', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Media', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Privacy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grandparents', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Netherlands', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-22T15:10:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Satariano and Claire Moses', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Satariano', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Claire', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Moses', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/58ded54b-f045-5ab7-b8e6-fbbd2041c0c2', 'word_count': 634, 'uri': 'nyt://article/58ded54b-f045-5ab7-b8e6-fbbd2041c0c2'}, {'abstract': 'A 15-year-old migrant girl pedaled hundreds of miles to bring her injured father back to their home village. India’s cycling federation has taken notice.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/22/world/asia/india-bicycle-girl-migrants.html', 'snippet': 'A 15-year-old migrant girl pedaled hundreds of miles to bring her injured father back to their home village. India’s cycling federation has taken notice.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW DELHI — She was a 15-year-old with a simple mission: bring papa home.Jyoti Kumari and her dad had nearly no money, no transport, and their village was halfway across India.And her dad, an out-of-work migrant laborer, was injured and could barely walk.So Jyoti told her dad: Let me take you home. He thought the idea was crazy but went along with it. She then jumped on a $20 purple bike bought with the last of their savings. With her dad perched on the rear, she pedaled from the outskirts of New Delhi to their home village, 700 miles away."Don’t worry, mummy,” she reassured her mother along the way, using borrowed cellphones. “I will get Papa home good.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/02/world/22india-bike-promo/merlin_172735011_9aa26fba-ff92-4896-827c-9acb6bb9db2c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/02/world/22india-bike-promo/merlin_172735011_9aa26fba-ff92-4896-827c-9acb6bb9db2c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/02/world/22india-bike-promo/merlin_172735011_9aa26fba-ff92-4896-827c-9acb6bb9db2c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/02/world/22india-bike-promo/merlin_172735011_9aa26fba-ff92-4896-827c-9acb6bb9db2c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/02/world/22india-bike-promo/merlin_172735011_9aa26fba-ff92-4896-827c-9acb6bb9db2c-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/02/world/22india-bike-promo/merlin_172735011_9aa26fba-ff92-4896-827c-9acb6bb9db2c-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/02/world/22india-bike-promo/merlin_172735011_9aa26fba-ff92-4896-827c-9acb6bb9db2c-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Lionhearted’ Girl Bikes Dad Across India, Inspiring a Nation', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Crossing India, Father on Back, A 15-Year-Old Inspires a Nation', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kumari, Jyoti', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bicycles and Bicycling', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Cycling Federation of India', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Migrant Labor (Non-Agriculture)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pedicabs and Rickshaws', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bihar (India)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quarantines', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-22T15:10:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeffrey Gettleman and Suhasini Raj', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeffrey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gettleman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Suhasini', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Raj', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/736688ee-ef5d-5414-8d44-fb654d4e1821', 'word_count': 1063, 'uri': 'nyt://article/736688ee-ef5d-5414-8d44-fb654d4e1821'}, {'abstract': 'Like so much else, summer internships have been upended by the pandemic, with hundreds of companies canceling their programs and rescinding offers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/22/business/coronavirus-summer-internships.html', 'snippet': 'Like so much else, summer internships have been upended by the pandemic, with hundreds of companies canceling their programs and rescinding offers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When she found out in mid-March that she had landed an internship with an education nonprofit in Washington, Lydia Burns, a senior at the University of Louisville, called her mother to celebrate. The whole world was falling apart, but here, finally, was good news.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/23/business/21virus-interns-print/merlin_172296933_e84a9295-d9c7-4886-9e45-da639be1411b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/23/business/21virus-interns-print/merlin_172296933_e84a9295-d9c7-4886-9e45-da639be1411b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/23/business/21virus-interns-print/merlin_172296933_e84a9295-d9c7-4886-9e45-da639be1411b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/23/business/21virus-interns-print/merlin_172296933_e84a9295-d9c7-4886-9e45-da639be1411b-superJumbo