, {'abstract': 'Officials say it will prevent a “devastating resurgence” of the coronavirus. Critics say it should have been imposed three months ago.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/22/world/europe/virus-britain-travel-quarantine.html', 'snippet': 'Officials say it will prevent a “devastating resurgence” of the coronavirus. Critics say it should have been imposed three months ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Britain on Friday moved ahead with a 14-day mandatory quarantine on arriving travelers, and heavy fines for those who break the rules, outlining strict new travel restrictions as other European nations are thinking about easing theirs.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/22/world/22virus-britain1/merlin_172748940_4f02dcaa-8c64-4d2b-a3aa-4820d102a1fa-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/22/world/22virus-britain1/merlin_172748940_4f02dcaa-8c64-4d2b-a3aa-4820d102a1fa-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/22/world/22virus-britain1/merlin_172748940_4f02dcaa-8c64-4d2b-a3aa-4820d102a1fa-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/22/world/22virus-britain1/merlin_172748940_4f02dcaa-8c64-4d2b-a3aa-4820d102a1fa-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/22/world/22virus-britain1/22virus-britain1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width'