osting testing totals but muddying the pandemic’s course.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/22/us/politics/coronavirus-tests-cdc.html', 'snippet': 'The Centers for Disease Control has been lumping together tests for active coronavirus with tests for recovered patients, boosting testing totals but muddying the pandemic’s course.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — As it tracks the coronavirus’s spread, the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention is combining tests that detect active infection with those that detect recovery from Covid-19 — a system that muddies the picture of the pandemic but raises the percentage of Americans tested as President Trump boasts about testing.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/22/us/politics/22dc-virus-testing1/merlin_172498422_87ffa4f7-cbbc-4df3-85c1-03c8e0fe8f89-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/22/us/politics/22dc-virus-testing1/merlin_172498422_87ffa4f7-cbbc-4df3-85c1-03c8e0fe8f89-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/22/us/politics/22dc-virus-testing1/merlin_172498422_87ffa4f7-cbbc-4df3-85c1-03c8e0fe8f89-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/22/us/politics/22dc-virus-testing1/merlin_172498422_87ffa4f7-cbbc-4df3-85c1-03c8e0fe8f89-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/22/us/politics/22d