 {'abstract': 'For renters with expiring leases, the next steps will depend largely on whether the home is rent-stabilized or market-rate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/23/realestate/should-you-renew-your-lease-if-youve-lost-your-job-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'For renters with expiring leases, the next steps will depend largely on whether the home is rent-stabilized or market-rate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Q: I have been furloughed from my job, and the lease on my Brooklyn apartment is up in June. My landlord sent me a renewal, but I am worried about committing to a year lease when I am living on savings and unemployment insurance. I asked if I could stay on as a month-to-month tenant, or sign at a lower rent, but I’ve gotten no response. What can I do?', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/24/realestate/23Ask/23Ask-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 118, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/24/realestate/23Ask/23Ask-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 118}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/24/realestate/23Ask/23Ask-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 201, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/24/realestate/23Ask/23Ask-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 402, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/24/realestate/23Ask/23Ask-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/24/realestate/23As