 about what it takes to stop infections.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/23/sunday-review/coronavirus-contact-tracing.html', 'snippet': 'An elite cadre of 20th-century syphilis hunters can teach us a lot about what it takes to stop infections.', 'lead_paragraph': 'How likely are you to answer an unknown number popping up on your caller ID? And if you were to pick up, how likely is it that you would disclose personal information about yourself and your family, friends and colleagues to the stranger on the other end of the line?', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/24/opinion/sunday/24murphy/merlin_172686111_e6af40b2-85c9-4b1f-aed5-92c5c8d0a7b3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/24/opinion/sunday/24murphy/merlin_172686111_e6af40b2-85c9-4b1f-aed5-92c5c8d0a7b3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/24/opinion/sunday/24murphy/merlin_172686111_e6af40b2-85c9-4b1f-aed5-92c5c8d0a7b3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/24/opinion/sunday/24murphy/merlin_172686111_e6af40b2-85c9-4b1f-aed5-92c5c8d0a7b3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/24/opinion/sunday/24murphy/merlin_172686111_e6af40b2-85c9-4b1f-aed5-92c5c8d0a7b3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thu