harf early on Saturday morning, officials said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/23/us/pier-45-fire-san-francisco.html', 'snippet': 'One firefighter was injured in the four-alarm blaze at Fisherman’s Wharf early on Saturday morning, officials said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'About 150 firefighters battled a four-alarm blaze that destroyed a quarter of the structures on Pier 45 in San Francisco early on Saturday morning, the authorities said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Fire at San Francisco’s Pier 45 Destroys a Quarter of Its Warehouses', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fire Destroys Warehouses Along San Francisco’s Waterfront', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'San Francisco (Calif)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fires and Firefighters', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': "Fisherman's Wharf (San Francisco, Calif)", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ships and Shipping', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-23T19:35:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Express', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Johnny Diaz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Johnny', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Diaz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e25fe8d5-5ba3-5ff0-af9b-d9690f75200d', 'word_count': 569, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e25fe8d5-5ba3-5ff0-af9b-d9690f75200d'}, {'abstract': 'Placing faith in a leader with little control over a virus may seem irrational, but it fills a very human need.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/23/world/asia/virus-leaders-popularity.html', 'snippet': 'Placing faith in a leader with little control over a virus may seem irrational, but it fills a very human need.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As world leaders grapple with when and how to safely reopen their countries, many are also facing a political problem: how to maintain support as they oversee tanking economies, stifling restrictions and staggering death tolls.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/23/world/23int-virus3/23int-virus3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/23/world/23int-virus3/23int-virus3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/23/world/23int-virus3/23int-virus3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/23/world/23int-virus3/23int-virus3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1297, 'width': 1947, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/23/world/23int-virus3/23int-virus3-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/23/world/23int-virus3/23int-virus3-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/23/world/23int-virus3/23int-virus3-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Rattled by a Pandemic, People Turn to Leaders — Any Leaders', 'kicker': 'The Interpreter', 'content_k