 Jets address a major need by adding Flacco, the Super Bowl 47 most valuable player.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/23/sports/football/joe-flacco-jets.html', 'snippet': 'For a pittance, the Jets address a major need by adding Flacco, the Super Bowl 47 most valuable player.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Jets are hoping that their most prominent addition this off-season — a former most valuable player of the Super Bowl — never takes a snap for them. Such is the plight of a backup quarterback, and that is the new role for the veteran Joe Flacco, who agreed to a one-year deal on Friday as he recovers from neck surgery.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/25/sports/23nfl-flacco1-print/merlin_170744208_0191bd75-fcdc-4d64-8d59-39a063d30e27-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/25/sports/23nfl-flacco1-print/merlin_170744208_0191bd75-fcdc-4d64-8d59-39a063d30e27-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/25/sports/23nfl-flacco1-print/merlin_170744208_0191bd75-fcdc-4d64-8d59-39a063d30e27-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/25/sports/23nfl-flacco1-print/merlin_170744208_0191bd75-fcdc-4d64-8d59-39a063d30e27-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/25/sports/23nfl-flacco1-print/23nfl-flacco-lede-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subT