/d4e694f8-d4e1-53c2-959e-013c289af193'}, {'abstract': 'Marchers defied social distancing rules and a water cannon to demonstrate against Beijing’s plan for new security legislation in the territory.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/24/world/asia/hong-kong-protest-coronavirus-china.html', 'snippet': 'Marchers defied social distancing rules and a water cannon to demonstrate against Beijing’s plan for new security legislation in the territory.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HONG KONG — Thousands of protesters swarmed some of Hong Kong’s busiest neighborhoods on Sunday, singing, chanting and erecting roadblocks of torn-up bricks and debris, as the police repeatedly fired tear gas, pepper spray and a water cannon during the city’s largest street mobilization in months.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hong Kong Police Fire Tear Gas as Protesters Resist China’s Grip', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rally Signals Fresh Round Of Defiance  In Hong Kong', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hong Kong Protests (2019)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Freedom of Assembly', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civil Rights and Liberties', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hong Kong', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-24T07:11:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_nam