en Dr. Denise McDermott, 49, isn’t seeing patients for telehealth appointments, there’s a good chance she’s wearing a robe. In fact, as soon as she and her 11-year-old son finish the video portion of their work and school days, they both make the switch. “It’s become our joke during the pandemic: We’re the robe family,” said Dr. McDermott, a psychiatrist in Manhattan Beach, Calif.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/21/fashion/25LOUNGEWEAR1/25LOUNGEWEAR1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 345, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/21/fashion/25LOUNGEWEAR1/25LOUNGEWEAR1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 345}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/21/fashion/25LOUNGEWEAR1/25LOUNGEWEAR1-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 589, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/21/fashion/25LOUNGEWEAR1/25LOUNGEWEAR1-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1178, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/21/fashion/25LOUNGEWEAR1/25LOUNGEWEAR1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/21/fashion/25LOUNGEWEAR1/25LOUNGEWEAR1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/21/fashion/25LOUNGEWEAR1/25LOUNGEWEAR1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 