f32ed054f'}, {'abstract': 'Memorial Day weekend in New York City usually marks the beginning of a vibrant summer to come. But this year traditions have been altered under the shadow of the coronavirus.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/25/nyregion/new-york-memorial-day-coronavirus-summer.html', 'snippet': 'Memorial Day weekend in New York City usually marks the beginning of a vibrant summer to come. But this year traditions have been altered under the shadow of the coronavirus.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Memorial Day weekend in New York City usually marks the beginning of a vibrant summer to come.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New Yorkers Embark on a Summer of Uncertainty', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Summer of Uncertainty', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Memorial Day', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beaches', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'your-feed-onlyinnewyork', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-25T09:00:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sandra E. Garcia', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sandra', 'middlename': 'E.', 'lastname': 'Garcia', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9f5d98b5-7528-5a53-989b-9c78dfeb387d', 'word_count': 712, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9f5d98b5-7528-5a53-989b-9c78dfeb387d'}, {'abstract': 'If you’re working from home indefinitely, it may be time to upgrade that home office.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/25/realestate/the-7-things-you-need-for-an-ergonomic-workstation.html', 'snippet': 'If you’re working from home indefinitely, it may be time to upgrade that home office.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After years of slumping at a desk, I’ve begun to suffer the aches that come from having a poor work-space setup. The stiff chair, the desk that’s too tall and the cramped laptop keyboard have all become literal pains in the neck (and shoulders and back and elsewhere). If your home-office setup is less than ideal, it may be time to upgrade the space ergonomically, especially now that most nonessential businesses plan to keep employees working from home indefinitely.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/realestate/25wirecutter-homeoffice4-print/25wirecutter-homeoffice4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/31/realestate/25wirecutter-homeoffice4-print/25wirecutter-homeoffice4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/realestate/25wirecutter-homeoffice4-print/25wirecutter-homeoffice4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/realestate/25wirecutter-homeoffice4-print/25wirecutter-homeoffice4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/realestate/25wirecutter-homeoffice4-print/25wirecutter-homeoffice4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard'