y Hans Taparia', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hans', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Taparia', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/1ed9e358-6ba6-5126-a6ea-319edd0cfd55', 'word_count': 1284, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1ed9e358-6ba6-5126-a6ea-319edd0cfd55'}, {'abstract': 'Not having an accurate, honest, nationwide way to tally Covid-19 cases will only add to the current tragedy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/25/opinion/coronavirus-death-toll.html', 'snippet': 'Not having an accurate, honest, nationwide way to tally Covid-19 cases will only add to the current tragedy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'We recently received the death certificate for my mother, who died May 4 in an assisted-living facility near New York City. “Acute Respiratory Distress Syndrome” was the primary cause. And the secondary — no surprise — was “suspected Covid-19.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/25/opinion/25Rosenthal/merlin_172433586_c6f3c695-a5d0-442c-b454-b115383029b8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/25/opinion/25Rosenthal/merlin_172433586_c6f3c695-a5d0-442c-b454-b115383029b8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/25/opinion/25Rosenthal/merlin_172433586_c6f3c695-a5d0-442c-b454-b115383029b8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/25/opinion/25Rosenthal/merlin_172433586_c6f3c695-a5d0-442c-b454-b115383029b8-superJumbo.j