us (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Part-Time Employment', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-26T09:00:05+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nikole Hannah-Jones', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nikole', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hannah-Jones', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/3f8a73e6-8e5e-5025-ad03-fde669c6cbf2', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/3f8a73e6-8e5e-5025-ad03-fde669c6cbf2'}, {'abstract': 'His routines were essentially acts of faith. And like even my daily iced coffee, so have mine been.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/26/magazine/my-father-leaned-on-routine-to-create-stability-now-i-do-too.html', 'snippet': 'His routines were essentially acts of faith. And like even my daily iced coffee, so have mine been.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Even by suburban standards, my father’s adherence to routine was astonishing. He took the same train out in the morning and the same train back at night, from the one job at the one company where he worked for almost 47 years, in the unchanging uniform of suit, tie and fedora. He had a worn leather breviary stuffed with prayers and Mass cards he’d been collecting for years, and he read through them all at the dining-room table every night during the 11 o’clock news. He drank exactly one Scotch-and-soda a week, Sunday afternoons during the game. We had the same vacation destination every year, often during the same calendar week.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/magazine/31Mag-LOR-1/31Mag-LOR-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 437, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/31/magazine/31Mag-LOR-1/31Mag-LOR-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 437}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/magazine/31Mag-LOR-1/31Mag-LOR-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 745, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/magazine/31Mag-LOR-1/31Mag-LOR-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1491, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/magazine/31Mag-LOR-1/31Mag-LOR-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/31/magazine/31Mag-LOR-1/31Mag-LOR-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/magazine/31Mag-LOR-1/31Mag-LOR-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'My Father Leaned on Routine to Create Stability. Now I Do, Too.', 'kicker': 'Letter of Recommendation', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Routine', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boredom', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pilates', 'rank': 3