topics like restaurants, health, regulations, science, cooking, new books and more — mostly culled from other sources. Look for everything from the use of murder hornets in spirits to Food & Wine magazine’s best new chefs selection for this year.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-news/merlin_172647534_64186706-3ff4-4517-a3f4-64a84feab609-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 482, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-news/merlin_172647534_64186706-3ff4-4517-a3f4-64a84feab609-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 482}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-news/merlin_172647534_64186706-3ff4-4517-a3f4-64a84feab609-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 823, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-news/merlin_172647534_64186706-3ff4-4517-a3f4-64a84feab609-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1647, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-news/merlin_172647534_64186706-3ff4-4517-a3f4-64a84feab609-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-news/merlin_172647534_64186706-3ff4-4517-a3f4-64a84feab609-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-news/merlin_172647534_64186706-3ff4-4517-a3f4-64a84feab609-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'New Site Aggregates Food News', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Subscribe: Free Weekly Look At the Food World', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'DigestThis.news', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Joachim, David', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-26T18:11:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4f532c11-fb0a-5d4a-8a68-ee4f73f7bd92', 'word_count': 110, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4f532c11-fb0a-5d4a-8a68-ee4f73f7bd92'}, {'abstract': 'Balkan Bites, from an Albanian chef, are hearty, flaky pastries filled with meat and cheese.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/26/dining/balkan-bites-burek.html', 'snippet': 'Balkan Bites, from an Albanian chef, are hearty, flaky pastries filled with meat and cheese.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Alida Malushi, a pastry chef who was born in Kosovo to an Albanian family, came to New York in 1991. With her niece, Ariana, she established Balkan Bites, making and selling her family’s burek, the filled pastries that are widely enjoyed throughout the Balkans, in Turkey and parts of the Middle East. Though she is calling them “bites,” they are considerably larger, almost the size of a bagel. Inside the flaky pastry spiral, there is the choice of meat, a tangy cheese mixture, and a combination of spinach and cheese. The pastries are sold frozen and take about 30 minutes in the oven without prior thawing, to emerge savory and burnished.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-bake/merlin_172451409_17e64280-0f40-4a5c-a450-6d5f3e0af363-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 665, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-bake/merlin_172451409_17e64280-0f40-4a5c-a450-6d5f3e0af363-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 665}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-bake/merlin_172451409_17e64280-0f40-4a5c-a450-6d5f3e0af363-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 925, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-bake/merlin_172451409_17e64280-0f40-4a5c-a450-6d5f3e0af363-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1849, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-bake/merlin_172451409_17e64280-0f40-4a5c-a450-6d5f3e0af363-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-bake/merlin_172451409_17e64280-0f40-4a5c-a450-6d5f3e0af363-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-bake/merlin_172451409_17e64280-0f40-4a5c-a450-6d5f3e0af363-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height'