ww.nytimes.com/2020/05/26/dining/questloves-potluck-food-network.html', 'snippet': 'This potluck will be broadcast on the Food Network and will raise money for America’s Food Fund.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The cookbook “Mixtape Potluck” by Questlove, the musician and activist, was published last fall. Now Questlove is turning it into a one-hour Food Network special and fund-raiser to be broadcast on Thursday, with celebrity participants like Olivia Wilde, George Lopez, Tiffany Haddish and others cooking, eating and drinking at a virtual dinner party. It benefits America’s Food Fund, a charity founded by Leonardo DiCaprio, Laurene Powell Jobs and Apple to donate funds to other nonprofits like No Kid Hungry. A number to text to donate will appear onscreen during the show.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-quest/25burner-quest-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 394, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-quest/25burner-quest-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 394}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-quest/25burner-quest-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 672, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-quest/25burner-quest-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1343, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-quest/25burner-quest-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-quest/25burner-quest-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-quest/25burner-quest-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Questlove Hosts a Virtual Dinner Party', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Join: Questlove Hosts a Virtual Dinner Party', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philanthropy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Thompson, Ahmir (Questlove)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Food Network', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parties (Social)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-26T19:36:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e3b6ba90-a8c8-50c5-8e03-a7b0ffa4873a', 'word_count': 127, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e3b6ba90-a8c8-50c5-8e03-a7b0ffa4873a'}, {'abstract': '“Spirits of Latin America” by Ivy Mix uses the classics as a starting point.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/26/dining/spirits-of-latin-america-ivy-mix.html', 'snippet': '“Spirits of Latin America” by Ivy Mix uses the classics as a starting point.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ivy Mix, an owner of Leyenda, a bar in Brooklyn, has put the focus on tequila, rum and pisco in her useful new book, “Spirits of Latin America.” Agave, sugar cane and grapes: Each one has its own chapter, giving the history, production methods and cultural influences of tequila (and mezcal), rum (and cachaça) and pisco (and Bolivian singani), and dipping into matters of archaeology, colonialism, slavery and politics. Cocktail recipes are included for all the liquors. Ms. Mix points out that all tequilas are mezcals, but not all mezcals are tequilas, and why; that there are easily defined types of rum; and that Prohibition killed a thriving American market for pisco, which is just now coming back. The cocktail recipes feature classics, as well as Ms. Mix’s recipes, like the lovely Palo Negro, combining tequila, rum and sherry. Her Brooklyn Burro with rum, lime, ginger syrup and pineapple juice is a winner.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-book/merlin_172686846_bc09fc91-5769-4530-b04d-f8db41e72312-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 844, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-book/merlin_172686846_bc09fc91-5769-4530-b04d-f8db41e72312-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 844}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-book/merlin_172686846_bc09fc91-5769-4530-b04d-f8db41e72312-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 729, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/dining/25burner-book/merlin_172686846_bc09fc91-5769-4530-b04d-f8db41e72312-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1457, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url