thers have started entirely new shows to serve their audiences’ needs in this strange new world. If the people you talk to in a given day has become limited to your property line, and you’d like to hear how others are dealing with the compounding challenges of the crisis, try tuning in to these new and familiar voices to make the silences a little less lonely. You can find them all in your listening app of choice.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/arts/27CORONAVIRUS-PODCAST-COMBO/27CORONAVIRUS-PODCAST-COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/27/arts/27CORONAVIRUS-PODCAST-COMBO/27CORONAVIRUS-PODCAST-COMBO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/arts/27CORONAVIRUS-PODCAST-COMBO/27CORONAVIRUS-PODCAST-COMBO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/arts/27CORONAVIRUS-PODCAST-COMBO/27CORONAVIRUS-PODCAST-COMBO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1360, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/arts/27CORONAVIRUS-PODCAST-COMBO/27CORONAVIRUS-PODCAST-COMBO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/27/arts/27CORONAVIRUS-PODCAST-COMBO/27CORONAVIRUS-PODCAST-COMBO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'image