/05/27/us/politics/china-hong-kong-pompeo-trade.html', 'snippet': 'The State Department announcement comes as President Trump weighs hard measures against China, which is expected to approve a national security law on Hong Kong on Thursday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Secretary of State Mike Pompeo announced on Wednesday that the State Department no longer considered Hong Kong to have significant autonomy under Chinese rule, a move that indicated the Trump administration was likely to end some or all of the United States government’s special trade and economic relations with the territory in southern China.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/us/politics/27dc-trumpchina1/merlin_172675209_b08d3a87-8faa-47b4-8a44-435a1dc6274c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 414, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/27/us/politics/27dc-trumpchina1/merlin_172675209_b08d3a87-8faa-47b4-8a44-435a1dc6274c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 414}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/us/politics/27dc-trumpchina1/merlin_172675209_b08d3a87-8faa-47b4-8a44-435a1dc6274c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 706, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/us/politics/27dc-trumpchina1/merlin_172675209_b08d3a87-8faa-47b4-8a44-435a1dc6274c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1413, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/27/us/politics/27dc-trumpchina1/27dc-trumpchina1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType