ith another veteran of “The Office.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'There’s a statistical likelihood that your image of Steve Carell is based primarily on “The Office,” and on the films “The 40-Year-Old Virgin” and “Anchorman” before that. In the streaming age it wouldn’t even be surprising if one of those venerable comedies was the last thing you watched him in. What are the odds that when you think of Carell you think of “Welcome to Marwen” or “Battle of the Sexes” or “Last Flag Flying,” recent movies whose box office ranged from poor to dismal?', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/28/arts/27space-force/27space-force-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/28/arts/27space-force/27space-force-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/28/arts/27space-force/27space-force-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/28/arts/27space-force/27space-force-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1369, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/28/arts/27space-force/27space-force-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/28/arts/27space-force/27space-force-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/28/arts/27space-force/27space-force-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '‘Space Force’ Review: Steve Carell, in a Familiar Orbit on Netflix', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Blandly Go Where Others Have Gone', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Netflix Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Carell, Steve', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Daniels, Greg (1963- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Space Force (TV Program)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-27T18:52:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mike Hale', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mike', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hale', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/662a6a11-4f08-5b53-a6d2-d833608b68e1', 'word_count': 715, 'uri': 'nyt://article/662a6a11-4f08-5b53-a6d2-d833608b68e1'}, {'abstract': 'He practiced an intellectual form of Christian theology called apologetics and sought to “connect the gospel with the life of the mind.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/27/us/ravi-zacharias-dead.html', 'snippet': 'He practiced an intellectual form of Christian theology called apologetics and sought to “connect the gospel with the life of the mind.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ravi Zacharias, an evangelist and author who became an important voice for Christians by making a rational argument for the existence of God and vigorously defending the faith against atheists, relativists, Buddhists and other challengers, died on