e you for FaceTiming Pamela Anderson. One second there is only you — staring, through a layer of iPhone glass, at your tired, trapped reflection, both of you hoping that is not how you actually look — and the next second there is Pamela Anderson, brightening the screen instantaneously and completely, the way a ray of sun stretching beyond a cloud can seem to bounce off the whole Pacific.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/fashion/28PAMELAANDERSON3/merlin_172626540_f09fb91d-87d4-44b3-8746-b6ea309b6f51-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 908, 'width': 588, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/fashion/28PAMELAANDERSON3/merlin_172626540_f09fb91d-87d4-44b3-8746-b6ea309b6f51-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 908, 'width': 588, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/fashion/28PAMELAANDERSON3/28PAMELAANDERSON3-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/31/fashion/28PAMELAANDERSON3/28PAMELAANDERSON3-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/fashion/28PAMELAANDERSON3/28PAMELAANDERSON3-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Pamela Anderson’s Garden of Eden', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pamela Anderson’s Garden of Eden', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': '