ntral Park, also puts Words With Friends and “Waves” on his list of stay-at-home essentials.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/28/arts/television/leslie-odom-jr-quarantine.html', 'snippet': 'The former “Hamilton” star, whose new TV series anoints him the protector of Central Park, also puts Words With Friends and “Waves” on his list of stay-at-home essentials.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Leslie Odom Jr. met Josh Gad when they were drama students at Carnegie Mellon. And when Gad calls, usually about some weirdly wonderful little project, Odom tends to pick up the phone. “I always know that it’s going to be a delightful experience,” Odom said, “because it’s no secret: Josh is a delightful dude.”', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/arts/31my10-odom-web/31my10-odom-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/31/arts/31my10-odom-web/31my10-odom-web-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/arts/31my10-odom-web/31my10-odom-web-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 675, 'width': 675, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/arts/31my10-odom-web/31my10-odom-web-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 675, 'width': 675, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/arts/31my10-odom-web/31my10-odom-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/31/arts/31my10-odom-we