: 807, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ae4d4410-84c5-55ae-ad2c-6927d15d1a86'}, {'abstract': 'A year after opening the Shed, Elizabeth Diller is trying to adjust to a world in which she and colleagues can no longer kick around ideas in person.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/28/arts/design/elizabeth-diller-architecture-virus.html', 'snippet': 'A year after opening the Shed, Elizabeth Diller is trying to adjust to a world in which she and colleagues can no longer kick around ideas in person.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The architect Elizabeth Diller typically works with pen on paper, bringing sketches to her West 26th Street studio, where she and her team at Diller Scofidio + Renfro puzzle over how best to realize those plans.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/28/arts/28virus-diller-dller/merlin_142131963_cb432160-f3f7-4770-8550-0c02ae0fee9a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/28/arts/28virus-diller-dller/merlin_142131963_cb432160-f3f7-4770-8550-0c02ae0fee9a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/28/arts/28virus-diller-dller/merlin_142131963_cb432160-f3f7-4770-8550-0c02ae0fee9a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/28/arts/28virus-diller-dller/merlin_142131963_cb432160-f3f7-4770-8550-0c02ae0fee9a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1536, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/28/ar