which had been postponed to Sept. 14 from April 20, was canceled on Thursday for the first time in its 124-year history.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/28/sports/boston-marathon-canceled.html', 'snippet': 'The race, which had been postponed to Sept. 14 from April 20, was canceled on Thursday for the first time in its 124-year history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Boston Marathon was canceled for the first time in its 124-year history, officials announced on Thursday, as the spread of the coronavirus made clear that earlier plans to postpone the race until September were too optimistic.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/28/sports/28boston-marathon/merlin_170462463_dc158e56-d218-4586-9be6-970e6ec2cd8b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/28/sports/28boston-marathon/merlin_170462463_dc158e56-d218-4586-9be6-970e6ec2cd8b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/28/sports/28boston-marathon/merlin_170462463_dc158e56-d218-4586-9be6-970e6ec2cd8b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/28/sports/28boston-marathon/merlin_170462463_dc158e56-d218-4586-9be6-970e6ec2cd8b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/28/sports/28boston-marathon/merlin_170462463_dc158e56-d218-4586-9be6-970e6ec2cd8b-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType