'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/4aa0e789-74f0-5f02-9aec-cd6f7910fe71', 'word_count': 464, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4aa0e789-74f0-5f02-9aec-cd6f7910fe71'}, {'abstract': 'Paralyzed from the waist down, she won gold in archery and swimming at the first Paralympic Games in 1960 and became an advocate of sports as therapy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/28/sports/olympics/margaret-maughan-dead.html', 'snippet': 'Paralyzed from the waist down, she won gold in archery and swimming at the first Paralympic Games in 1960 and became an advocate of sports as therapy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Her back was ramrod straight, her arms steady and her aim true. When Margaret Maughan pulled back the string on her bow — from her seat in a wheelchair — she shot her way into Paralympic history.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '29', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/obituaries/31MAUGHAN/27MAUGHAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 773, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/31/obituaries/31MAUGHAN/27MAUGHAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 773}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/obituaries/31MAUGHAN/27MAUGHAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 796, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/obituaries/31MAUGHAN/27MAUGHAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1200, 'width': 932, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/obituaries/31MAUGHAN/27MAUGHAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/31/obituaries/31MAUGHAN/27MAUGHAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/obituaries/31MAUGHAN/27MAUGHAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Margaret Maughan, Medal-Winning Wheelchair Athlete, Dies at 91', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Margaret Maughan, 91, Gold and Silver Medalist  At Several Paralympics', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Maughan, Margaret (1928-2020)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Paralympic Games', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Disabilities', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARCHERY', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Stoke Mandeville Games', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Guttman, Ludwig', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-28T19:56:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Obits', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Olympics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katharine Q. Seelye', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katharine', 'middlename': 'Q.', 'lastname': 'Seelye', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/ba0c52c7-babb-5edf-b8ac-3a63dfcd424f', 'word_count': 953, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ba0c52c7-babb-5edf-b8ac-3a63dfcd424f'}, {'abstract': 'Aside from its toll on human life, the pandemic has also stolen little things, like the ability to smell and taste. How a neurologist found a deeper relationship with wine.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/28/dining/drinks/wine-coronavirus-sense-of-smell.html', 'snippet': 'Aside from its toll on human life, the pandemic has also stolen little things, like the ability to smell and taste. How a neurologist found a deeper relationship with wine.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This is a story about what happens when one of life’s joys is taken away, perhaps forever. In this case it’s wine, but it could as easily have been painting, cooking, dancing, or playing golf or tennis.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/03/dining/28pour/merlin_172722315_1777fcdf-30fc-4bc6-bedc-15a30b784d5a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/06/03/dining/28pour/merlin_172722315_1777fcdf-30fc-4bc6-bedc-15a30b784d5a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/03/dining/28pour/merlin_172722315_1777fcdf-30fc-4bc6-bedc-15a30b784d5a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/03/dining/28pour/merlin_172722315_1777fcdf-30fc-4bc6-bedc-15a30b784d5a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/06/03/dining/28pour/merlin_172722315_1777fcdf-30fc-4bc6-bedc-15a30b784d5a-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/06/03/dining/28pour/m