NN crew showed America an actual offense against the First Amendment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For days, President Trump has been on a rampage against Twitter for its treatment of him, and it’s easy to see why. Early Friday morning, after a tweet from him about the violence in Minneapolis declared, “When the looting starts, the shooting starts,” Twitter dispatched police officers to the White House, who handcuffed Mr. Trump and took him into custody on live television in view of the entire nation.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/29/arts/29cnn-notebook/29cnn-notebook-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 301, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/29/arts/29cnn-notebook/29cnn-notebook-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 301}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/29/arts/29cnn-notebook/29cnn-notebook-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 513, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/29/arts/29cnn-notebook/29cnn-notebook-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1027, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/29/arts/29cnn-notebook/29cnn-notebook-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/29/arts/29cnn-notebook/29cnn-notebook-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/29/arts/29cnn-notebook/29cnn-notebook-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'CNN Arrest Is What Actual Censorship Looks Like', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Live Look At Censorship, No Tweets Involved', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CNN', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Floyd, George (d 2020)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Freedom of the Press', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jimenez, Omar (1993- )', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Minneapolis (Minn)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (Minneapolis, Minn)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'George Floyd Protests (2020)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-29T17:10:29+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Poniewozik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Poniewozik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4fe94f4c-3036-5944-96b2-dbb5f7d7b7c3', 'word_count': 826, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4fe94f4c-3036-5944-96b2-dbb5f7d7b7c3'}, {'abstract': 'The governor, a Democrat, is a former member of the National Guard who deployed the force after the killing of George Floyd.', 'web_