Coronavirus Reopenings', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-31T14:45:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Monica Potts', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Monica', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Potts', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/b95d6156-67bc-55da-864f-435873dad0ea', 'word_count': 1493, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b95d6156-67bc-55da-864f-435873dad0ea'}, {'abstract': 'In response to rising anxiety over the coronavirus, the shoe retailer Zappos started a customer service line that people can call for anything — even to chat.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/31/business/zappos-coronavirus.html', 'snippet': 'In response to rising anxiety over the coronavirus, the shoe retailer Zappos started a customer service line that people can call for anything — even to chat.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Rose Wang called the customer service line at Zappos, all she wanted was a quick confirmation that a gift receipt was included with the hot pink Crocs she had ordered for her mother for Mother’s Day.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/nyregion/00xp-virus-zappos-combo/merlin_173011143_078c545a-079d-4bff-a58f-047f89329895-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 333, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/31/nyregion/00xp-virus-zappos-combo/merlin_173011143_078c545a-079d-4bff-a58f-047f89329895-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 333}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/nyregion/00xp-virus-zappos-combo/merlin_173011143_078c545a-079d-4bff-a58f-047f89329895-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 568, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/nyregion/00xp-virus-zappos-combo/merlin_173011143_078c545a-079d-4bff-a58f-047f89329895-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1136, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/nyregion/00xp-virus-zappos-combo/00xp-virus-zappos-combo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/31/nyregion/00xp-virus-zappos-combo/00xp-virus-zappos-combo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/nyregion/00xp-virus-zappos-combo/00xp-virus-zappos-combo-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Retail Therapy: Zappos Offers to Listen to Pandemic Worries', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Customer Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Zappos', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quarantines', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Commerce', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-31T14:48:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Express', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jenny Gross', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jenny', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gross', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2c70a251-6d77-59d2-ae74-c75b02e9e56e', 'word_count': 749, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2c70a251-6d77-59d2-ae74-c75b02e9e56e'}, {'abstract': 'We grew up in a family of activists. I wanted everyone to see his calm bravery.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/31/opinion/chris-cooper-central-park.html', 'snippet': 'We grew up in a family of activists. I wanted everyone to see his calm bravery.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I grew up in a family of activists and my parents were teachers. They raised me and my brother, Chris, to never shy from fighting injustice. From police brutality, to the war in Iraq, to climate change, we’ve lifted our voices in protest. So when I saw Chris’s video of his recent encounter with a white woman named Amy Cooper (no relation) in New York’s Central Park, it was surreal that he had captured on his cellphone the kind of racism we had always railed against. All of a sudden, I became one of the hundreds of black women who have watched a video of a loved one being accosted.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/opinion/31cooperWeb/merlin_172879908_3d676602-c21c-4a71-a758-57b0bb18d5a4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/31/opinion/31cooperWeb/merlin_172879908_3d676602-c21c-4a71-a758-57b0bb18d5a4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/opinion/31cooperWeb/merlin_172879908_3d676602-c21c-4a71-a758-57b0bb18d5a4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/opinion/31cooperWeb/merlin_172879908_3d676602-c21c-4a71-a758-57b0bb18d5a4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/opinion/31cooperWeb/31cooperWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2020/05/31/opinion/31cooperWeb/31cooperWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/opinion/31cooperWeb/31cooperWeb-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Chris Cooper Is My Brother. Here’s Why I Posted His Video.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black People', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blacks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cooper, Amy (May 25, 2020 Central Park Incident)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cooper, Christian (Birder)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality, Misconduct and Shootings', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Black Lives Matter Movement', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Central Park (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Video Recordings, Downloads and Streaming', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2020-05-31T14:56:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melody Cooper', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melody', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cooper', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/b7677546-cca6-5a43-b3fe-8aafcbb76e40', 'word_count': 1192, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b7677546-cca6-5a43-b3fe-8aafcbb76e40'}, {'abstract': 'The many roles involved in producing a film rule out the notion of a single, indispensable artist.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2020/05/31/opinion/acting-movies-art.html', 'snippet': 'The many roles involved in producing a film rule out the notion of a single, indispensable artist.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This essay is part of The Big Ideas, a special section of The Times’s philosophy series, The Stone, in which more than a dozen artists, writers and thinkers answer the question, “Why does art matter?” The entire series can be found here.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/multimedia/31bigideas-studi/31bigideas-studi-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2020/05/31/multimedia/31bigideas-studi/31bigideas-studi-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/multimedia/31bigideas-studi/31bigideas-studi-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/multimedia/31bigideas-studi/31bigideas-studi-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2020/05/31/multimedia/31bigideas-studi/31bigideas-studi-thumbStandard.